  },
  Stage_141289_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He is hard to notice. He makes no sound. He comes all at once.
In their flourishing years people speak His name as though it has nothing to do with them... until they realize He has become a friend who follows like a shadow.]]
  },
  Stage_141289_Name = {Text = "The Reason"},
  Stage_141290_Desc = {
    Text = "The liveliest feasts for the grandest celebrations—we raise our cups, we gather.\nNo one pauses to wonder whether the same will moves behind all those vessels.\nNo one asks if any soul lingers within the hollow shells."
  },
  Stage_141290_Name = {
    Text = "Mead and Myrrh: I"
  },
  Stage_141291_Desc = {
