  },
  Stage_141291_Name = {
    Text = "Dark Forest: IV"
  },
  Stage_141742_Desc = {
    Text = "♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nThere was once a lone, crying bird, searching for its other half: a bird who had lost its wings, a bird whose feathers had all been plucked bare. He wished a wish that could never come true; his brother had forgotten even the memories between them.\n♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nIt's all right, it's all right. They still have a sweet, sweet resting place to share. They will slip into a peaceful, peaceful sleep that nothing will ever disturb again."
  },
  Stage_141742_Name = {
    Text = "Feather: III"
  },
  Stage_141743_Desc = {
    Text = "♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nThere was once a lone, crying bird, searching for its other half: a bird who had lost its wings, a bird whose feathers had all been plucked bare. He wished a wish that could never come true; his brother had forgotten even the memories between them.\n♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nIt's all right, it's all right. They still have a sweet, sweet resting place to share. They will slip into a peaceful, peaceful sleep that nothing will ever disturb again."
  },
  Stage_141743_Name = {
    Text = "Feather: VI"
  },
  Stage_141744_Desc = {
    Text = "Did you like my story? You didn't? Huuuhhh?! What do I have to say to make you believe me, hmm? All right, all right—stop digging so deep, won't you? That sort of thing really does hurt a girl's feelings, you know. Here, take a bite of this apple. It's super sweet, I promise it's real! Just as real as every single word of this story!"
  },
  Stage_141744_Name = {
    Text = "Apple: Madness"
  },
  Stage_141745_Desc = {
    Text = "Did you like my story? You didn't? Huuuhhh?! What do I have to say to make you believe me, hmm? All right, all right—stop digging so deep, won't you? That sort of thing really does hurt a girl's feelings, you know. Here, take a bite of this apple. It's super sweet, I promise it's real! Just as real as every single word of this story!"
  },
  Stage_141745_Name = {Text = "Apple: II"},
  Stage_141746_Desc = {
    Text = "Did you like my story? You didn't? Huuuhhh?! What do I have to say to make you believe me, hmm? All right, all right—stop digging so deep, won't you? That sort of thing really does hurt a girl's feelings, you know. Here, take a bite of this apple. It's super sweet, I promise it's real! Just as real as every single word of this story!"
  },
  Stage_141746_Name = {Text = "Apple: I"},
  Stage_141747_Desc = {
    Text = "Yes, yes—a person really can be this unlucky. Her whole life held nothing but lies. She believed this time, and she'll believe the next time too; for one small scrap of hope, she swallowed down the bitter fruit of every lie. And so, at the end of all these lies, at the end of her life... we look into her eyes and find nothing there but hatred."
  },
  Stage_141747_Name = {
    Text = "Eye: Madness"
  },
  Stage_141748_Desc = {
    Text = "The story has come this far, and you begin to waver. The clues were there from the very start—so what is fate drawing you here to witness? At the far end of the thread, what kind of truth lies tied to the other side? What is buried beneath the snow, and just how many will get the wish they came for? You don't know. The journey isn't even half over; all you can do is keep following where it leads."
  },
  Stage_141748_Name = {Text = "Thread: VI"},
  Stage_141749_Desc = {
    Text = "♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nThere was once a lone, crying bird, searching for its other half: a bird who had lost its wings, a bird whose feathers had all been plucked bare. He wished a wish that could never come true; his brother had forgotten even the memories between them.\n♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nIt's all right, it's all right. They still have a sweet, sweet resting place to share. They will slip into a peaceful, peaceful sleep that nothing will ever disturb again."
  },
  Stage_141749_Name = {
    Text = "Feather: IV"
  },
  Stage_141750_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh, you are the little shard of a god, the savior of Kadath, the hope within all destruction, the new life in every dead end, and the one and only Keeper of Mythag. 
You grip tight the key that has carried you this far, and your heart brims with resolve. Now... how did that line go again...? May the silver key guide us!]]
  },
  Stage_141750_Name = {Text = "Key: III"},
  Stage_141751_Desc = {
    Text = "♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nThe little girl has walked the roads too long, oh, far too long. Loneliness weighs upon her shoulders, and longing gnaws away at her heart. She cannot find it anywhere; not one of her tricks will work.\n♬~~♫~~♪~~♫~~♪~~♫~~\nIt's all right, it's all right. Everything she is looking for is inside the mirror. The mirror holds the moon up in the sky, and the moon has fallen down into the ripples of the glass."
  },
  Stage_141751_Name = {
    Text = "Mirror: Part I"
  },
  Stage_141752_Desc = {
    Text = "We're clear on everything else... but the crown, now, why did <Italic:that> turn up here of all places? Who was careless enough to fall for a swindler's trick? Well, that's plainly not something for us to fuss over in this part. As for how it all turns out... I'll explain when it's time for the next story!"
  },
  Stage_141752_Name = {Text = "Crown: IV"},
  Stage_141753_Desc = {
    Text = "The story has come this far, and you begin to waver. The clues were there from the very start—so what is fate drawing you here to witness? At the far end of the thread, what kind of truth lies tied to the other side? What is buried beneath the snow, and just how many will get the wish they came for? You don't know. The journey isn't even half over; all you can do is keep following where it leads."
  },
