  Stage_143876_Desc = {
    Text = "How does one become a legendary investigator? First, every deep well holds a great many secrets.\nSecond, before you throw yourself down to the bottom—remember that a shotgun doesn't necessarily have to be legally owned."
  },
  Stage_143876_Name = {
    Text = "The Well: VI"
  },
  Stage_143877_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humans go to school, and so do Awakeners. 
She is an Awakener now, so of course she'll go to the same school as you. 
For your safety, please stay alert.]]
  },
  Stage_143877_Name = {
    Text = "At School: VI"
  },
  Stage_143878_Desc = {
    Text = "Yes, even a legendary investigator cannot guarantee victory every time.\n... But that's alright—we still have one last drop of vodka."
  },
  Stage_143878_Name = {
    Text = "Nightcap: VI"
  },
  Stage_143879_Desc = {
    Text = "The world will become a living hell in an instant—but will it, truly? Is it not possible that nothing ever changed at all, and you have simply been enduring it all along?"
  },
  Stage_143879_Name = {
    Text = "Neurotrauma: I"
  },
  Stage_143880_Desc = {
    Text = [[
This is a wondrous place where birth, death, and rebirth converge all at once, alongside the greatest suffering in the world and the greatest joy. 
