  Stage_143916_Desc = {
    Text = "How does one become a legendary investigator? First, every deep well holds a great many secrets.\nSecond, before you throw yourself down to the bottom—remember that a shotgun doesn't necessarily have to be legally owned."
  },
  Stage_143916_Name = {
    Text = "The Well: II"
  },
  Stage_143917_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humans go to school, and so do Awakeners. 
She is an Awakener now, so of course she'll go to the same school as you. 
For your safety, please stay alert.]]
  },
  Stage_143917_Name = {
    Text = "At School: Madness"
  },
  Stage_143918_Desc = {
    Text = [[
This is a wondrous place where birth, death, and rebirth converge all at once, alongside the greatest suffering in the world and the greatest joy. 
Here, the delights and griefs of all who dwell within, and everything else besides, are so utterly untranslatable to one another.]]
  },
  Stage_143918_Name = {
    Text = "The Hospital: IV"
  },
  Stage_143919_Desc = {
    Text = "The world will become a living hell in an instant—but will it, truly? Is it not possible that nothing ever changed at all, and you have simply been enduring it all along?"
  },
  Stage_143919_Name = {
    Text = "Neurotrauma: IV"
  },
  Stage_143920_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Let's paint the ceiling and walls in our favorite color. Let's fill the fridge with our favorite food. Let's adopt a pet we'll both shower with love.
This is our home, and it belongs to the two of us alone.]]
  },
  Stage_143920_Name = {
    Text = "Our Home: IV"
  },
  Stage_143921_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Lovers share a meal together in the restaurant; companions discuss their plans over the same table. The food has been exposed to too many secrets. 
Fortunately, it has no mouth to speak... <Italic:Right?>]]
  },
  Stage_143921_Name = {
    Text = "Dining Table: V"
  },
