  Stage_144353_Name = {
    Text = "Suggested Translation"
  },
  Stage_145312_Desc = {
    Text = "Welcome! Welcome to the arena of the Astral Cetus! Welcome to this hall of slaughter!\nGenerals, assassins, bounty hunters, gladiators... all living legends gather here.\nFight, ally, betray—use every means at your disposal, survivor.\nThere is but one rule: only the last one standing may push open that door."
  },
  Stage_145312_Name = {
    Text = "Hall of Slaughter: IV"
  },
  Stage_145313_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Honor, justice, dignity... mere chains the weak weave for themselves.
She hungers only for what is stronger. In this blood-soaked arena, there is perhaps but one remaining worthy of her regard.]]
  },
  Stage_145313_Name = {Text = "Conquest"},
  Stage_145314_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The way to please the Astral Cetus is simple: enough blood, enough strength, enough desire...
When you have trampled over countless corpses, congratulations. You have earned the right to join this contest.]]
  },
  Stage_145314_Name = {
    Text = "The Offering: III"
  },
  Stage_145315_Desc = {
    Text = "Welcome! Welcome to the arena of the Astral Cetus! Welcome to this hall of slaughter!\nGenerals, assassins, bounty hunters, gladiators... all living legends gather here.\nFight, ally, betray—use every means at your disposal, survivor.\nThere is but one rule: only the last one standing may push open that door."
  },
  Stage_145315_Name = {
    Text = "Hall of Slaughter: III"
  },
  Stage_145316_Desc = {
    Text = [[
