When you have trampled over countless corpses, congratulations. You have earned the right to join this contest.]]
  },
  Stage_145316_Name = {
    Text = "The Offering: I"
  },
  Stage_145317_Desc = {
    Text = "Of all the perils here, the wild beasts are the gentlest."
  },
  Stage_145317_Name = {
    Text = "Caged Beast: V"
  },
  Stage_145318_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Finally, you have everything you ever wanted: strength, wealth, glory, and endless power.
Blood drips from the Crown, staining your eyes red. Laugh to your heart's content, O great new king. Bathe in this blood of desire, and await your inevitable rot.]]
  },
  Stage_145318_Name = {
    Text = "Crown of Desire: I"
  },
  Stage_145319_Desc = {
