  Stage_145323_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Prostrate your body. Bow your head.

That is the only fitting posture for ants facing a god.]]
  },
  Stage_145323_Name = {Text = "Ants"},
  Stage_145324_Desc = {
    Text = "Nothing lies behind her; no end lies before her. And she is glad of it."
  },
  Stage_145324_Name = {
    Text = "Lightness of the Crown"
  },
  Stage_145325_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You stand before the mirror and see the one you love most. A parent, a child, a dear friend, or perhaps yourself...
Love. Leviathan despises this word. The Emissary's soul allows for no burdens.
Raise your blade, and kill them.
From this moment, you shall have no weaknesses.
From this moment, you shall have no way back.]]
  },
