  Stage_146229_Desc = {
    Text = [[
All the seats are filled; the slumbering god lets slip a laugh at last.
Your place was on, and not at, the table.]]
  },
  Stage_146229_Name = {
    Text = "Guests at the Feast"
  },
  Stage_146230_Desc = {
    Text = "The snowy mountains have but one rule: whatever you hear, do not answer."
  },
  Stage_146230_Name = {
    Text = "Do Not Answer"
  },
  Stage_146231_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Seven offerings, seven pedestals, one door leading back to the origin of the world.
No wish was ever a gift given freely.]]
  },
  Stage_146231_Name = {
    Text = "Summit of Voided Wills"
  },
  Stage_146232_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Our bird has found his other half at last.
Today they fly far, never to return.]]
  },
  Stage_146232_Name = {
    Text = "Today the Birds Depart"
  },
  Stage_146233_Desc = {
    Text = "Clear lake water mirrors the starry sky—and mirrors, too, desires no one will name aloud.\nLies are cast into flame; what remains is not necessarily truth."
  },
  Stage_146233_Name = {
    Text = "The Unfrozen Moon"
  },
  Stage_146234_Desc = {
    Text = [[
In the tales of old, the Lord of the Dead warned Orpheus: never look back, or lose your beloved forever.
But had he the heart to ignore his beloved's voice, would he ever have carried his lyre across the river of death, through the vale of shadow, and down into the dark halls of the underworld to find her?]]
  },
  Stage_146234_Name = {
    Text = "Looking Back"
  },
  Stage_146235_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The blizzard sealed the road behind them and delivered an unfamiliar companion.
Something rustled deep in the darkness, as though the whole snowbound mountain were watching those who had wandered in.]]
  },
  Stage_146235_Name = {
    Text = "Seventh Traveler"
  },
  Stage_146236_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Your companion was the forerunner all along; she reached the snow line long before you did.
Face it now. From the very beginning, hers was a presence none could escape.]]
  },
  Stage_146236_Name = {
    Text = "The Forerunner"
  },
  Stage_146237_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The blizzard tore open his cloak, and a long-hidden secret at last unfurled its wings.
Some wings were never born for flight.]]
  },
  Stage_146237_Name = {
    Text = "Day of Leaving the Nest"
  },
  Stage_146238_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The blizzard sealed the road behind them and delivered an unfamiliar companion.
Something rustled deep in the darkness, as though the whole snowbound mountain were watching those who had wandered in.]]
  },
  Stage_146238_Name = {
    Text = "Seventh Traveler"
  },
  Stage_146239_Desc = {
    Text = "They count their food, their fuel, their rope, their oxygen... Yet the wishes tucked inside their backpacks stay unweighed."
  },
  Stage_146239_Name = {
    Text = "The Backpacks"
  },
  Stage_146240_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The campfire illuminates every face, and every wish held close within.
The long night is not yet spent; let us take one more hour of rest together.]]
  },
  Stage_146240_Name = {
    Text = "Fireside, After Dark"
  },
  Stage_146241_Desc = {
    Text = "<Italic:Do not go gentle into that good night.>"
  },
  Stage_146241_Name = {Text = "Good Night"},
  Stage_146242_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Your companion was the forerunner all along; she reached the snow line long before you did.
Face it now. From the very beginning, hers was a presence none could escape.]]
  },
  Stage_146242_Name = {
    Text = "The Forerunner"
  },
  Stage_146243_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The truth will never be sharp enough to cut open a god's belly.
And so the liar and the lied-tos sat together in the dark, weaving as one a lie that would tear open the road home.]]
  },
  Stage_146243_Name = {
    Text = "Pact of Liars"
  },
  Stage_146244_Desc = {
    Text = [[
