  },
  Stage_146355_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Every long dream must in the end dissolve.
All that was yearned for, all that was longed for, all that was looked up to, all that was stood upon...
At the end of the dream, all shall scatter as ashes, into the eternal.]]
  },
  Stage_146355_Name = {
    Text = "The Long Dream"
  },
