  Stage_146928_Desc = {
    Text = "A princess in distress rescued by a knight — this is a well-known traditional tale."
  },
  Stage_146928_Name = {Text = "Princess"},
  Stage_146929_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The dragon awakens, and hatred is stirred once more. The beast's breath surges forth from the rocks, the venom of war burns fiercely, unextinguished to this day.
The earth thunders with a mighty roar.]]
  },
  Stage_146929_Name = {
    Text = "Dragon's Lair"
  },
  Stage_146930_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The knight set forth upon an unfamiliar road, passing through barren fields and hills, with only his shadow for company.
Perhaps he had long since died, yet with no one to bear witness, even that was forgotten.
The world is so utterly silent.]]
  },
  Stage_146930_Name = {Text = "Tomb"},
  Stage_146931_Desc = {
    Text = "Forty days and forty nights of rain fell upon the land. We cannot go on. We will go on."
  },
  Stage_146931_Name = {
    Text = "Apple Island"
  },
  Stage_146932_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The dragon awakens, and hatred is stirred once more. The beast's breath surges forth from the rocks, the venom of war burns fiercely, unextinguished to this day.
The earth thunders with a mighty roar.]]
  },
  Stage_146932_Name = {
    Text = "Dragon's Lair"
  },
  Stage_146933_Desc = {
    Text = [[
That is the root and flower of the heavenly garden, the crown of all wishes in this world, an inexhaustible abundance.
Drink the wine in your cup, and you shall see what you desire most.]]
  },
  Stage_146933_Name = {Text = "Holy Grail"},
  Stage_146934_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The dragon awakens, and hatred is stirred once more. The beast's breath surges forth from the rocks, the venom of war burns fiercely, unextinguished to this day.
The earth thunders with a mighty roar.]]
  },
  Stage_146934_Name = {
    Text = "Dragon's Lair"
  },
