  },
  Stage_20444_Desc = {
    Text = "Ernst Claudel was once the lord of Besançon.\nEven today, the family retains considerable prestige in the region."
  },
  Stage_20444_Name = {
    Text = "Epistolary Embrace"
  },
  Stage_20445_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Offspring, more offspring, an unceasing torrent of offspring...
They are her only beloved.]]
  },
  Stage_20445_Name = {Text = "Hive-Mind"},
  Stage_20697_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Every moment, someone dies; just as every moment, someone is born.
Only shadows are different. Devoured by time, they are bound to this land of suffering.
Endlessly, neither alive nor dead.]]
  },
  Stage_20697_Name = {
    Text = "Shadow Hymn"
  },
  Stage_20698_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God said they were born to endure suffering and be bled dry.
As the sun must rise, and the rain must fall.
All is as it should be.]]
  },
  Stage_20698_Name = {
    Text = "Bitter Rain"
  },
  Stage_20699_Desc = {
    Text = [[
We march for the triumph of victory.
We live for a perfect death.]]
  },
  Stage_20699_Name = {Text = "From Afar"},
  Stage_20700_Desc = {
