    Text = "Prisoner of Fate"
  },
  Stage_24425_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Snip.
She swore to sever all ties with her former life.
Like cutting a ribbon clean in two.]]
  },
  Stage_24425_Name = {Text = "For Sorel"},
  Stage_24426_Desc = {
    Text = "Once again, you fall captive to your own pity, plunging headlong into her soul."
  },
  Stage_24426_Name = {
    Text = "Trial of the Fall"
  },
  Stage_24427_Desc = {
    Text = [[
At the story's dawn, you shall witness a magnificent death.
It is the beginning, yet far from the end.]]
  },
  Stage_24427_Name = {Text = "Brindisi"},
  Stage_24428_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The girl's name is Sorel; she's the pride of the village.
Obedient and neat, clothed in white, she walks in dainty steps like a true lady.
Yet unlike those ladies, she never dreams.]]
  },
  Stage_24429_Desc = {
    Text = "Logic is much like whiskey: take too much, and you lose all its benefit."
  },
  Stage_24429_Name = {
    Text = "Masked Harmony"
  },
  Stage_24430_Desc = {
    Text = "Under His tender cultivation, the cancer called power-lust at last spread like blooming roses."
  },
  Stage_24430_Name = {
    Text = "Crimson Revel"
  },
  Stage_24431_Desc = {
    Text = "Slurp. Slurp.\nWe writhe in the dark, we whisper among ourselves.\nOur bloated bodies drag winding trails of tears beneath the moonlight—salty ones, oh yes."
  },
  Stage_24431_Name = {Text = "Egg"},
  Stage_24432_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Scones, macarons, and steaming cocoa...
The maid's wish is simple: to eat well. And then a little better still.]]
  },
  Stage_24432_Name = {
    Text = "The Maid's Wish"
  },
  Stage_24433_Desc = {
    Text = "Beware, beware.\nThe lady you all admire is no true lady.\nAnd yet—who cares?"
  },
  Stage_24433_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Guide"
  },
  Stage_24434_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The rose bows its slender head amid the tolling bell; the vulture loses itself among fetid blooms.
No one sings. No one speaks. The world fades with her death.]]
  },
  Stage_24434_Name = {
    Text = "Funeral of the Rose"
  },
  Stage_24435_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She drains the springs dry and strangles the innocent birds.
She brings golden winds that sweep across the fields like falling stars.
She sets the world ablaze with desire, then reduces it to ashes.]]
  },
  Stage_24435_Name = {
    Text = "La Traviata"
  },
  Stage_24439_Desc = {
    Text = [[
