Every building had collapsed; black slime licked at the sky; white freesias dissolved into the eternal void.
All was silent. All seemed to be asleep.
Only her tears were cold, sticking to her face and soaking her hair.]]
  },
  Stage_38792_Name = {
    Text = "Deep Well: Remembrance Part V"
  },
  Stage_38793_Desc = {
    Text = "The Queen and her immortal city—Isarawu.\nTwins beloved of the cosmos, gently bound by the umbilical cord of fate.\nSome say the wise Queen led her people to Isarawu, as the <Italic:Book of Revelation> depicts.\nOthers say the riverbed of Isarawu surged without cease, until it brought forth the Queen herself."
  },
