  Stage_38800_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When she opened her eyes, the world was unraveling.
Every building had collapsed; black slime licked at the sky; white freesias dissolved into the eternal void.
All was silent. All seemed to be asleep.
Only her tears were cold, sticking to her face and soaking her hair.]]
  },
  Stage_38800_Name = {
    Text = "Deep Well: Remembrance Part VII"
  },
  Stage_38801_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"I have nothing left," said the one-eyed street child. "Only this flower to offer you, great Queen."
She took the white freesia, yet felt a strange confusion. This scene seemed to have played out countless times in the depths of her memory.
Endlessly repeating, like the labyrinth that imprisoned the Minotaur.]]
  },
  Stage_38801_Name = {
    Text = "Freesia's Bloom: Remembrance Part VII"
  },
  Stage_38802_Desc = {
    Text = [[
At night, the Queen stood on the palace terrace, gazing down at the city thousands of feet below.
Day after day, whenever she sought to step beyond the palace, dizziness, tears, and vast blanks of memory would follow.
"Are you ready? To face the truth of this world."
She drew a deep breath and leapt from the terrace.]]
  },
