  Stage_44201_Name = {
    Text = "Penance: Flourish Part III"
  },
  Stage_44202_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Panic over illness left them consumed by resentment.
"Why does only he receive a Blessing? I am sick too!"
"My condition is the gravest. I should be the first to be blessed!"]]
  },
  Stage_44202_Name = {
    Text = "Inner Struggle: Flourish Part IV"
  },
  Stage_44203_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Only what benefits them is good; every Blessing that does not fall upon them is a curse.
"A blessing? It is nothing but wicked blood magic!"
"This must be sorcery. He is a demon!"]]
  },
  Stage_44203_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Reproach: Flourish Part II"
  },
  Stage_44204_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They refuse to understand, to accept.
Their world holds only black and white, though even they can't define it.
"Burn him, burn him!"
"Burn this heretic bishop! Let evil perish!"]]
  },
