  Stage_44551_Desc = {
    Text = "Merciful Father, please forgive me. Allow me to make amends and atone for my sins."
  },
  Stage_44551_Name = {
    Text = "Our Failing"
  },
  Stage_44552_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The dust has settled. The guilty will face judgment; those who press on will continue.
Tomorrow is a new day.]]
  },
  Stage_44552_Name = {
    Text = "White Hope Ignited"
  },
  Stage_44553_Desc = {
    Text = "It was meant to be an ordinary afternoon—but for the Keeper of Mythag, the ordinary is plainly a luxury."
  },
  Stage_44553_Name = {Text = "Repentance"},
  Stage_44554_Desc = {
    Text = "Purification, purification... Is this the ravings of a madman, or some distorted belief?"
  },
  Stage_44554_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Sigil"
  },
  Stage_44555_Desc = {
    Text = "They have been consumed by flames, stripped of reason."
  },
  Stage_44555_Name = {
    Text = "Fury's Madness"
  },
  Stage_44556_Desc = {
    Text = "What others possess, they must possess; what others lack, they must possess all the more—however futile, however absurd."
  },
  Stage_44556_Name = {
    Text = "Jealousy's Blade"
  },
  Stage_44557_Desc = {
    Text = "Stop, rest, you have toiled enough. Lie down, sleep, no one has the heart to reproach you."
  },
  Stage_44557_Name = {
    Text = "Surrender to Languor"
  },
  Stage_44558_Desc = {
    Text = "You trudge back along the path you came, only to encounter ravenous fangs."
  },
  Stage_44558_Name = {
    Text = "Hunger Sated"
  },
  Stage_44559_Desc = {
    Text = "When you look into the mirror, is it a phantom you see, or your true desire?"
  },
  Stage_44559_Name = {
    Text = "Purge the Sin"
  },
  Stage_44560_Desc = {
    Text = "Merciful Father, please forgive me. Allow me to make amends and atone for my sins."
  },
  Stage_44560_Name = {
    Text = "Our Failing"
  },
  Stage_44561_Desc = {
    Text = "Merciful Father, please forgive me. Allow me to make amends and atone for my sins."
  },
  Stage_44561_Name = {
    Text = "Our Failing"
  },
  Stage_44715_Name = {
    Text = "Benevolent Bishop Trial"
  },
  Stage_45411_Name = {
    Text = "Farewell Kiss"
  },
  Stage_46169_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She memorized all probabilities, yet remained as bewildered as any seminary student.
For madness defies prediction. Regrettably, it is the world's true norm.]]
  },
  Stage_46169_Name = {
    Text = "Grand Slam Covenant"
  },
  Stage_46170_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She memorized all probabilities, yet remained as bewildered as any seminary student.
For madness defies prediction. Regrettably, it is the world's true norm.]]
  },
  Stage_46170_Name = {
    Text = "Grand Slam Covenant"
  },
  Stage_46171_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curse renders you a serpent locked in perpetual hibernation.
It is as ancient as your umbilical cord.]]
  },
  Stage_46171_Name = {
    Text = "Cursed Binding"
  },
  Stage_46172_Desc = {
    Text = "The girl was once Mason.\nSoon she will be like Ulysses—no one at all.\nAnd then, soon after, she will be everyone."
  },
  Stage_46172_Name = {Text = "\"Origin\""},
  Stage_46173_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curse renders you a serpent locked in perpetual hibernation.
It is as ancient as your umbilical cord.]]
  },
  Stage_46173_Name = {
    Text = "Cursed Binding"
  },
  Stage_46174_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It ends here. It ends with me.
Do not test your Lord.]]
  },
  Stage_46174_Name = {Text = "Ends Here"},
  Stage_46175_Desc = {
    Text = "Over the years, pilgrims carved a passage through the snow-capped mountains, anchoring reality in place.\nThey stand motionless, mouths agape, as though locked in an endless roar—"
  },
  Stage_46175_Name = {
    Text = "Pilgrim's Chant"
  },
  Stage_46176_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curse renders you a serpent locked in perpetual hibernation.
It is as ancient as your umbilical cord.]]
  },
  Stage_46176_Name = {
    Text = "Cursed Binding"
  },
  Stage_46177_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She memorized all probabilities, yet remained as bewildered as any seminary student.
For madness defies prediction. Regrettably, it is the world's true norm.]]
  },
  Stage_46177_Name = {
    Text = "Grand Slam Covenant"
  },
  Stage_46178_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She watched herself on the verge of claiming the world.
She fixed her gaze upon that long, narrow shadow and said nothing.]]
  },
  Stage_46178_Name = {
    Text = "Shadow Tale"
  },
  Stage_46179_Desc = {
    Text = "Her comedy is one of a kind. It is composed of vast, desolate nights, the moon, and tears."
  },
  Stage_46179_Name = {
    Text = "Awaiting Comedy"
  },
  Stage_46180_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When all things slumber, the serpent stirs.
When all things collapse, the serpent is restored.]]
  },
  Stage_46180_Name = {
    Text = "Sleepless Serpent"
  },
  Stage_46181_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The cat divides its emotions into eighteen pieces and devises a different pitch of "meow" for each.
Thus it can say "I'm hungry," "come play with me," "leave me be."
And also: "I miss you."]]
  },
  Stage_46181_Name = {
    Text = "All-Knowing Cat"
  },
  Stage_46182_Desc = {
    Text = [[
With the tolling of the aged bell comes a faint and fading blessing.
Happy holidays. Happy holidays. Happy holidays.]]
  },
  Stage_46182_Name = {
    Text = "Golden Fugue"
  },
