  },
  Stage_46547_Desc = {
    Text = [[
I don't know when she became the judge here.
She tried a person whose name was hidden and sentenced them to death.
Then she heard the revelation: "You are that person."
Yes, all the prisoners, judges, and priests here have the same face.]]
  },
  Stage_46547_Name = {
    Text = "Amygdala's Call: Emerge Part IV"
  },
  Stage_46548_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Hell is an empty room lined with countless mirrors.
She dares not open her eyes, for everywhere she looks is her own pale, terrified face.
Somewhere in the void, a voice intones:
This is retribution. In life you had but one shell; in death, you are confronted with countless.]]
  },
  Stage_46548_Name = {
    Text = "Mirror's Gaze: Emerge Part VI"
  },
  Stage_46549_Desc = {
