  Stage_51761_Desc = {
    Text = [[
For the last time, she gazed at where the King's statue once stood.
There was no statue, and no King.]]
  },
  Stage_51761_Name = {
    Text = "Dream of Lemuria"
  },
  Stage_51762_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The statue and she gaze at one another from afar.
Between them lies the vast span of time, and a dream from which she has never awoken.]]
  },
  Stage_51762_Name = {
    Text = "Dark Statue"
  },
  Stage_51763_Desc = {
    Text = "Hope—is Lemuria's most precious poison.\nThey sing wildly and drink it deep; they savor its bitterness as though it were honey."
  },
  Stage_51763_Name = {
    Text = "The Priestess' Ritual"
  },
  Stage_51764_Desc = {
    Text = "Stars, fate, gods... Before Them, fairness means nothing."
  },
  Stage_51764_Name = {
    Text = "The Virtue of Lies"
  },
  Stage_51765_Desc = {
    Text = "Struggling in the rain. Saying farewell in the rain."
  },
  Stage_51765_Name = {
    Text = "In the Rain"
  },
  Stage_51766_Desc = {
    Text = "Answer me, my Lord. I shall offer you my most precious gift."
  },
  Stage_51766_Name = {
    Text = "Offering to the King"
  },
  Stage_51767_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Enjoy,\" He said. \"Enjoy the humble warmth; enjoy the fate that has been prepared.\""
  },
  Stage_51767_Name = {Text = "Fish Flesh"},
  Stage_51768_Desc = {
    Text = "His will is interwoven like a web of stars; He lingers within the everlasting void, awaiting you upon dream's threshold."
  },
  Stage_51768_Name = {
    Text = "Praying in the Deep"
  },
  Stage_51769_Desc = {
    Text = "Prayer—is the first thing the Lemurians learned."
  },
  Stage_51769_Name = {Text = "Prophecy"},
  Stage_51770_Desc = {
    Text = [[
In that tranquil and blissful land, the bosom friends of old gaze at each other.
They will join hands, and together they will ascend the stairs to the Divine Realm.]]
  },
  Stage_51770_Name = {
    Text = "My Dear Friend"
  },
  Stage_51771_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Blood. Tears. Sacrifice. Revelry. Slaughter.
Another tale of the stars begins, yet the stars care not.
They shine, as they always have; from time immemorial, unchanging.]]
  },
  Stage_51771_Name = {
    Text = "Hearken, O Stars"
  },
  Stage_51772_Desc = {
    Text = "She was her best friend. She has always been."
  },
  Stage_51772_Name = {Text = "Old Friend"},
  Stage_51773_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Drink, of this sweet wine. Dance, of this passionate dance.
The High Priestess of the lost kingdom enters the hall, and she lays her hand upon her newly faithful.]]
  },
  Stage_51773_Name = {
    Text = "Bloodied Banquet"
  },
  Stage_51774_Desc = {
    Text = "Mist veils the face of the seeker. Mist veils the heart of the King."
  },
  Stage_51774_Name = {
    Text = "Behind the Mist"
  },
  Stage_51775_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The palaces of old have dissolved into phantoms, leaving only echoes of bygone dreams.
Upon the withered throne rests the King's corpse, still recounting the fables of yore.]]
  },
  Stage_51775_Name = {
    Text = "Phantom of the Past"
  },
