  Stage_53775_Desc = {
    Text = "Before departing, the biographer looked back at the rose-covered mansion—it was not a ten-thousandth of its owner's radiance.\nThe legend of Lady Sorel continues, unfolding at this very moment. We will all bear witness."
  },
  Stage_53775_Name = {
    Text = "Finale: Part II"
  },
  Stage_53776_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She has many identities: socialite, merchant, broker, collector...
but never herself. Regrettably, Lady Rose never mourned this.
To her, the raw and unrefined are beneath mention; complexity and murkiness are the pinnacle of taste.]]
  },
