Quiet. Quiet. Quiet.
Beneath the ice, all things are eternal; even breath is frozen solid. Survival and death are synonyms, just as hibernation and revival are indistinguishable.
Elworth will never know a spring of her own.]]
  },
  Stage_54844_Name = {
    Text = "Dormancy: Part VI"
  },
  Stage_54845_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She had no say over the embryo implanted within her chest.
No say over where to flee, whose hand to take, or with whom to wander.
Before a fate adrift in the sea's illusions, everyone is merely a lamb awaiting slaughter.]]
  },
  Stage_54845_Name = {
    Text = "Lamb's Sacrifice: Part II"
  },
  Stage_54846_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Mechanical contraptions, a killer trapped inside, a murder staged as suicide...
