  Stage_56404_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Murphy learned that she was not the first Divine Maiden; across thousands of years, a similar heartbeat had stirred within the bodies of countless girls.
Across countless times and spaces, countless hearts beat in layered unison.]]
  },
  Stage_56404_Name = {
    Text = "Time's Fracture: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56404_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56405_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the final dignified resting place for all life.\nThe deep sea serves as the coffin, the heavens and earth as the bier—the great god is laid to rest in the ocean currents."
  },
  Stage_56405_Name = {
    Text = "Veil of Shroud: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56405_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56407_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It descended in silence and without heart.
Its heart persists within her blood, sustaining the pulse of life without desire.]]
  },
  Stage_56407_Name = {
    Text = "His Coming: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56407_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56408_Desc = {
    Text = "She counts the stars overhead, waiting for a moment she does not welcome.\n\"When the stars align\"—when the stars rise above the sea, she will become one of them."
  },
  Stage_56408_Name = {
    Text = "Yellow Star: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56408_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56409_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She had no say over the embryo implanted within her chest.
No say over where to flee, whose hand to take, or with whom to wander.
Before a fate adrift in the sea's illusions, everyone is merely a lamb awaiting slaughter.]]
  },
  Stage_56409_Name = {
    Text = "Lamb's Sacrifice: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56409_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56410_Desc = {
    Text = [[
No guillotine was needed to execute her.
It was her own mother who dealt the blow.]]
  },
  Stage_56410_Name = {
    Text = "Executioner's Blade: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56410_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56411_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Quiet. Quiet. Quiet.
Beneath the ice, all things are eternal; even breath is frozen solid. Survival and death are synonyms, just as hibernation and revival are indistinguishable.
Elworth will never know a spring of her own.]]
  },
  Stage_56411_Name = {
    Text = "Dormancy: Madness"
  },
  Stage_56411_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_56843_Desc = {
