  Stage_56909_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Blossom like fireworks, even if life itself is the fuel.
When all destinations converge, why endure endless suffering instead of embracing radiant brilliance?]]
  },
  Stage_56909_Name = {
    Text = "Radiant Fall: Part II"
  },
  Stage_56910_Desc = {
    Text = "Countless souls crave truth, marching onward in waves. Countless fools clutch shards of reality, mistaking blind epiphanies for divine light, preaching of heavenly splendor. \nOnly she found the wine of truth—and drank the cursed nectar in one draught.\nGulp.\nNow she lies poisoned, rotting from within. Proof, as countless idiots have shown: truth is but venom in a chalice.\nA sip brings torment; a swallow brings demise. Her time dwindles... yet still she offers you a shared cup."
  },
  Stage_56910_Name = {
    Text = "True Venom: Part V"
  },
  Stage_56911_Desc = {
    Text = "She extends her hand—will you dance?\nForward, back, your steps mirror hers alone.\nClasp her palm, match her rhythm, never bow your head.\nEven as the abyss gapes beneath your feet."
  },
