  },
  Stage_57003_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Essence: Part II"
  },
  Stage_57004_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Set forth, then.
Whether this path leads to "Wisdom" or "Folly," only the journey itself can reveal.]]
  },
  Stage_57004_Name = {
    Text = "Set Forth: Part IV"
  },
  Stage_57395_Desc = {
    Text = "Contrary to common wisdom: in reality, having no alibi may in fact be safer.\nWithout solid evidence, the police cannot make an arrest.\nSo please, culprits—spare us your needless machinations."
  },
  Stage_57395_Name = {
    Text = "Alibi Confession: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57395_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57396_Desc = {
    Text = "\"The narrator is the killer\"—a tired trick, devoid of artistry or craft.\nRegrettably, I have stumbled upon it once again."
  },
  Stage_57396_Name = {
    Text = "Ruse Reversed: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57396_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57397_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Detective Rule One: the more ordinary and timid a client appears, the greater the case that lies behind them.
Judging by appearances has no place here.]]
  },
  Stage_57397_Name = {
    Text = "Uninvited Guest: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57397_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57398_Desc = {
    Text = "Should you find a headless or faceless corpse at the scene, do not doubt it—\ntheir identity has been swapped."
  },
  Stage_57398_Name = {
    Text = "Headless Enigma: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57398_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57399_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An unremarkable face, an unremarkable history, an unremarkable name...
If all these elements converge in one person, feel free to strike them from the list of suspects.
Do not ask me why.]]
  },
  Stage_57399_Name = {
    Text = "Fortunate Nobody: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57399_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57400_Desc = {
    Text = [[
1, 2, 3...
Even by the time the fifth victim was killed, someone as clever as myself had yet to crack the case.
Why? Because this nursery rhyme has ten verses.]]
  },
  Stage_57400_Name = {
    Text = "A Twig: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57400_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57401_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Mechanical contraptions, a killer trapped inside, a murder staged as suicide...
Honestly, would it not be far simpler to hire a killer than to go to all the trouble of constructing a locked room?]]
  },
  Stage_57401_Name = {
    Text = "Lost Chamber: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57401_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57402_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Do not shun your friends in the police.
In the world of deduction, they tend to play the role of those led astray by the killer.
Their greatest utility: ruling out the wrong suspects at the earliest opportunity.]]
  },
  Stage_57402_Name = {
    Text = "Sleuth's Ally: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57402_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57403_Desc = {
    Text = "If, having read the foregoing rules of deduction, your enthusiasm for becoming a detective remains undiminished—\nthen good luck to you, you irredeemable fool."
  },
  Stage_57403_Name = {
    Text = "Epilogue: Madness"
  },
  Stage_57403_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_57673_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Betrayal between close friends, kin turning on kin, love curdling into hatred...
He feeds on the twisted emotions of humanity with delight, fancying Himself a naturalist.
"The purest, most authentic emotion. All-natural, unprocessed, with a simple and refreshing taste."]]
  },
  Stage_57673_Name = {
    Text = "Tragedy Show"
  },
  Stage_57674_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Eliminate all impossibilities, and only the truth remains.
Quantum physicists, of course, would disagree.]]
  },
  Stage_57674_Name = {Text = "A Truth"},
  Stage_57675_Desc = {
    Text = "\"If... then...\" is the phrase that detectives hate the most.\nIt means failure, regret, and the bitterness of gin—and he has been sober for many years."
  },
  Stage_57675_Name = {
    Text = "Beneath Reality"
  },
  Stage_57676_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Being liked by everyone is a remarkable feat; being despised by everyone, equally so.
And he manages both without effort.
Well done, Mr. Next-Monday!]]
  },
  Stage_57676_Name = {
    Text = "Next Monday, Sir"
  },
  Stage_57677_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He belongs to yesterday, yet he knows today.
He dwells among the gods, and his life has no end.]]
  },
  Stage_57677_Name = {
    Text = "Coffin Wall"
  },
  Stage_57678_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humans are dull creatures.
Erect a wooden board between them, and they can no longer recognize each other's scent.]]
  },
  Stage_57678_Name = {
    Text = "First Meeting"
  },
  Stage_57679_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Eight little soldiers, awake until eleven;
One hanged himself, leaving only seven.]]
  },
  Stage_57679_Name = {
    Text = "None Survived"
  },
  Stage_57681_Desc = {
    Text = "They are all in a dead end, yet all yearn for new life."
  },
  Stage_57681_Name = {
    Text = "Final Salute"
  },
  Stage_57682_Desc = {
    Text = "The relationship between an old house and its ghost is much like that of cheese and bacon.\nHardly anyone can say which came first—only that, by the time anyone notices, the two are inseparable."
  },
  Stage_57682_Name = {
    Text = "Haunted House"
  },
  Stage_57683_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It is nothing more than deducing so-called "causes" from results or stances.
Such farce has played out everywhere throughout human history.]]
  },
  Stage_57683_Name = {
    Text = "Inverse Deduction"
  },
  Stage_57684_Desc = {
    Text = "They are all in a dead end, yet all yearn for new life."
  },
  Stage_57684_Name = {
    Text = "Final Salute"
  },
  Stage_57685_Desc = {
    Text = [[
May good fortune attend you, Detective.
See you next time.]]
  },
  Stage_57685_Name = {Text = "Good Luck!"},
  Stage_57686_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Whenever exams approach, I find myself hoping for a disaster.
Floods, hurricanes, an asteroid strike... anything to cast reality aside for a moment.
Just a short while.]]
  },
  Stage_57686_Name = {
    Text = "Uninvited Guest"
  },
  Stage_57687_Desc = {
    Text = "They are all in a dead end, yet all yearn for new life."
  },
  Stage_57687_Name = {
    Text = "Final Salute"
  },
  Stage_58064_Desc = {
    Text = [[
O fools, you lit the flames and consigned hope and salvation to ash.
How does this self-proclaimed justice taste, as you struggle in the pitch-black of death?]]
  },
  Stage_58064_Name = {
    Text = "Penance: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58064_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_58065_Desc = {
    Text = [[
O fools, you lit the flames and consigned hope and salvation to ash.
How does this self-proclaimed justice taste, as you struggle in the pitch-black of death?]]
  },
  Stage_58065_Name = {
    Text = "Penance: Part VI"
  },
  Stage_58066_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They refuse to understand, to accept.
Their world holds only black and white, though even they can't define it.
"Burn him, burn him!"
"Burn this heretic bishop! Let evil perish!"]]
  },
  Stage_58066_Name = {
    Text = "Paranoia's Grip: Part IV"
  },
