  },
  Stage_58449_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Reverberation.
At the cost of his life, his movement echoes without end through His halls.]]
  },
  Stage_58449_Name = {
    Text = "Echoes: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58449_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58450_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curtain falls.
Head held high, he recedes behind the descending red velvet.]]
  },
  Stage_58450_Name = {
    Text = "Curtain Call: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58450_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58451_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Fourth Gate.\nOne who enters the Fourth Gate shall behold Their true visage.\nTo witness the cosmos in its immensity is to comprehend one's own insignificance. Do not presume an ant can shake a mighty tree."
  },
  Stage_58451_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Knowledge: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58451_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58452_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Welcome to the Dollhouse, where a thousand identical smiles await.
Hehe... which one used to be your dear friend?]]
  },
  Stage_58452_Name = {
    Text = "Doll's Haven: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58453_Desc = {
    Text = [[
There were never any Gates in this world.
Yet yearning hearts forged them: countless ones, each promising paradise.
But the old prophecy whispers: no true Gate exists.
Those who seek heaven on earth shall instead throw open hell's maw.]]
  },
  Stage_58453_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Oracle: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58454_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Silken threads spill from the doll's fingers, threading through the world's machinery.
Click, sputter... one twitch, and reality unravels.
But what dangles above the marionette, forcing its endless dance for the void?]]
  },
  Stage_58454_Name = {
    Text = "Strings of Fate: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58455_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Joyful movement.
They move across the whole of the earth; their defiant forms are something to behold.]]
  },
  Stage_58455_Name = {
    Text = "Minuet: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58455_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58456_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Third Gate.\nOne who enters the Third Gate is unshackled from shallow reason, and may thus perceive the knowledge that lies beyond the boundary."
  },
  Stage_58456_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Reason: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58456_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58457_Desc = {
    Text = "Dance, dance, never cease your motion.\nSwirl your skirts, spin wild circles—the world itself spirals toward oblivion.\nCast off your chains, join this final masquerade.\nDance with abandon, and behold the eternal sunset."
  },
  Stage_58457_Name = {
    Text = "Carnival's Sway: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58458_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sonata form.
From one, three are born; within the triangle, an unblinking eye surveys the earth.]]
  },
  Stage_58458_Name = {
    Text = "Allegro: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58458_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58459_Desc = {
    Text = "She gained everything the king prophesied—great power, firm faith. Bearing the Sin of once questioning the king, she set out to welcome the Divine Realm."
  },
  Stage_58459_Name = {
    Text = "Devout Heart: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58459_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_58460_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Fifth Gate.\nOne who enters the Fifth Gate partakes of the supreme secret shared with the cosmos.\nAll things are but a single breath drawn by Their being, and shall be undone by Their exhalation."
  },
  Stage_58460_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Unity: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58460_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58461_Desc = {
    Text = "She extends her hand—will you dance?\nForward, back, your steps mirror hers alone.\nClasp her palm, match her rhythm, never bow your head.\nEven as the abyss gapes beneath your feet."
  },
  Stage_58461_Name = {
    Text = "The Invitation: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58462_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Sixth Gate.\nOne who enters the Sixth Gate becomes the link between all worlds, seeking eternal existence across ten thousand dimensions."
  },
  Stage_58462_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Worlds: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58462_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58463_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Lyrical movement.
Nourishment, propagation, life without cease.]]
  },
  Stage_58463_Name = {
    Text = "Adagio: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58463_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58464_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Set forth, then.
Whether this path leads to "Wisdom" or "Folly," only the journey itself can reveal.]]
  },
  Stage_58464_Name = {
    Text = "Set Forth: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58464_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58465_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A symphony is not a solitary endeavor.
Strings, woodwinds, brass, percussion.
Each ordered instrumental section bows its head, awaiting his direction.]]
  },
  Stage_58465_Name = {
    Text = "Grand Design: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58465_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58466_Desc = {
    Text = "He followed the sound and stepped onto the podium.\nHis stride was steady, his bearing composed.\nNone knew he had come because of a dream—and that the dream's owner had long since been lost."
  },
  Stage_58466_Name = {
    Text = "Lost Dream's Guide: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58466_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58467_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the First Gate.\nOne who enters the First Gate must break their chains, forsake their nature, and forget the self.\nFor a vision bound to the individual is too frail to bear the weight of the absurd truth."
  },
  Stage_58467_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Essence: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58467_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58468_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Second Gate.One who enters the Second Gate must not presume to judge right from wrong.\nFor such distinctions are but the whims of rule-makers, and the seat of truth lies beyond all knowledge."
  },
  Stage_58468_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Truth: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58468_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58469_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Rondo form.
He will point the way toward the final road, and face destruction head-on.]]
  },
  Stage_58469_Name = {
    Text = "Finale: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58469_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58470_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The outline of the Divine Realm appeared before her eyes. The tolling of the Divine Realm echoed in her ears. She will fulfill the King's prophecy, without cease.
These words guided her through the vast darkness of her life.]]
  },
  Stage_58470_Name = {
    Text = "The Arrival: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58470_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_58471_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When the apocalypse arrives, the world will be festering with sores, and the vortex of decay shall consume all living things.
Pray, seek, for that never-existent Gate to salvation.]]
  },
  Stage_58471_Name = {
    Text = "Frenzied Calamity: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58472_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The day she lost everything, she finally realized that only the King could save the people of Lemuria.
She waits, in that distant the Divine Realm, to be reunited with all that she has lost.]]
  },
  Stage_58472_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Witness: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58472_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_58473_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Lemuria perished. Our Lord never cared about this land.
The Divine Realm never existed.]]
  },
  Stage_58473_Name = {
    Text = "Tremor: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58473_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_58474_Desc = {
    Text = "Why do you still refuse to relinquish? Why do you remain so stubbornly unenlightened?\n...To protect them?\nIf that is your answer, then you shall ultimately surrender your bones, your blood, your consciousness—your everything."
  },
  Stage_58474_Name = {
    Text = "Behind the Gate: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58474_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58475_Desc = {
    Text = "A lone star hangs in the viscous darkness.\nIt swells, ignites, transforms into infinite cotton candy.\nSomeone's entire lifetime of love and hatred crystallized—tell me, what flavor do you taste?"
  },
  Stage_58475_Name = {
    Text = "Stars: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58476_Desc = {
    Text = "Prayer was the first thing the Lemurians learned. Yet the one who appeared before her to protect her was never her king."
  },
  Stage_58476_Name = {
    Text = "Eternal Query: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58476_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Seamare"},
  Stage_58477_Desc = {
    Text = "Countless souls crave truth, marching onward in waves. Countless fools clutch shards of reality, mistaking blind epiphanies for divine light, preaching of heavenly splendor. \nOnly she found the wine of truth—and drank the cursed nectar in one draught.\nGulp.\nNow she lies poisoned, rotting from within. Proof, as countless idiots have shown: truth is but venom in a chalice.\nA sip brings torment; a swallow brings demise. Her time dwindles... yet still she offers you a shared cup."
  },
  Stage_58477_Name = {
    Text = "True Venom: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58478_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Blossom like fireworks, even if life itself is the fuel.
When all destinations converge, why endure endless suffering instead of embracing radiant brilliance?]]
  },
  Stage_58478_Name = {
    Text = "Radiant Fall: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58479_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the Seventh Gate.\nHere, the torrent of time is stilled, and eternal wisdom shall guide the lost seeker from the deepest confusion."
  },
  Stage_58479_Name = {
    Text = "Ultimate Gate: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58479_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58480_Desc = {
    Text = "Opening—the theme declared.\nHe will narrate beginning and end, inhalation and exhalation."
  },
  Stage_58480_Name = {
    Text = "Overture: Madness"
  },
  Stage_58480_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_58691_Desc = {
    Text = "The wind dies down, the snow clears, and all things grow."
  },
  Stage_58691_Name = {Text = "One Spring"},
  Stage_58692_Desc = {
    Text = "Mourn, or marvel. This is a warrior's declaration of war against the mountains."
  },
  Stage_58692_Name = {Text = "Thornpeak"},
  Stage_58693_Desc = {
    Text = "Her garments stir in the wind; her bewilderment hums faintly. She stands before you."
  },
  Stage_58693_Name = {Text = "Reunion"},
  Stage_58694_Desc = {
    Text = "You did not find the enemy. The enemy found you."
  },
  Stage_58694_Name = {
    Text = "Dark Figure"
  },
  Stage_58695_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Come back, child. The mountain calls.
Answer your mother's gentle summons, and return to the tranquil embrace of fate.]]
  },
  Stage_58695_Name = {
    Text = "Call of the Summits"
  },
  Stage_58696_Desc = {
    Text = "Their stories are unknown to all. Their names go unmourned."
  },
  Stage_58696_Name = {Text = "Sacrifice"},
  Stage_58697_Desc = {
    Text = "Elworth doesn't seem to welcome your polite visit."
  },
  Stage_58697_Name = {
    Text = "Snowfield Stranger"
  },
  Stage_58698_Desc = {
    Text = "Between the pallor of moonlight and the whiteness of snow, blood is the third color."
  },
  Stage_58698_Name = {
    Text = "Endless Frost"
  },
  Stage_58699_Desc = {
    Text = "It's hard to say which one is more dangerous."
  },
  Stage_58699_Name = {
    Text = "Ally or Foe"
  },
  Stage_58700_Desc = {
    Text = "Mourn, or marvel. This is a warrior's declaration of war against the mountains."
  },
  Stage_58700_Name = {Text = "Thornpeak"},
  Stage_58701_Desc = {
    Text = "Mourn, or marvel. This is a warrior's declaration of war against the mountains."
  },
  Stage_58701_Name = {Text = "Thornpeak"},
  Stage_58976_Desc = {
    Text = "\"I'll watch as you steadfastly tread this path to ruin... I'll mourn you at your funeral.\""
  },
  Stage_58976_Name = {
    Text = "Path of Preservation"
  },
  Stage_58977_Desc = {
    Text = "\"I cherish many scenes in the theater. But my favorite is the moment they hurl the most exquisite porcelain from the attic.\""
  },
  Stage_58977_Name = {
    Text = "Father and Daughter"
  },
  Stage_58978_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Rough, long, illusory. Everyone has their own path to face.
When you finally stand at the starting point, do you have the courage to gaze into the distance ahead of you?]]
  },
  Stage_58978_Name = {Text = "Path"},
  Stage_58979_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Rhythm. Melody. The soft overtones of the strings pervade your mind.
Amid the silent gazes of the audience, the conductor ascends to his stage.]]
  },
  Stage_58979_Name = {
    Text = "The Conductor"
  },
  Stage_58980_Desc = {
    Text = [[
His frail body was submerged in the boiling earth.
In that illusory dimension, he confronted the Black Pool alone.]]
  },
  Stage_58980_Name = {
    Text = "Broken Shell"
  },
  Stage_58981_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A wrong note, a missing cue... any slip could doom the entire performance.
Practice. Await your applause through endless practice.]]
  },
  Stage_58981_Name = {Text = "Rehearsal"},
  Stage_58982_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Is oblivion the world's final purification? Mythag never agrees.
The people within this campus will fight to remember.]]
  },
  Stage_58982_Name = {Text = "Lex Lethis"},
  Stage_58982_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Finale"},
  Stage_58983_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Lighthearted dance music, joyful banter, and a dull, monotonous work.
Yes, take a rest during the third movement. It's safe, calm, and uneventful.]]
  },
  Stage_58983_Name = {
    Text = "Movement III"
  },
  Stage_58984_Desc = {
    Text = [[
No way to plead. No way to escape. This is the fate of this world.
Defeat them. Kill them. And then, save them.]]
  },
  Stage_58984_Name = {Text = "Fate"},
  Stage_58985_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A twist foretold loses its force, but he never cares.
The pleasure he anticipates lies elsewhere.]]
  },
  Stage_58985_Name = {
    Text = "Dexterian Twist"
  },
  Stage_58986_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Shh.
The last of the audience has taken their seats. The true performance is about to begin.]]
  },
  Stage_58986_Name = {Text = "Entry"},
  Stage_58987_Desc = {
    Text = "When information is asymmetrical, the more perfect it appears, the more grievously it errs."
  },
  Stage_58987_Name = {
    Text = "Good Student, Bad Student"
  },
  Stage_58988_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Mythag is independent of the jurisdiction of both the Kingdom of Leonia and the Mystia Treaty Committee. Any unauthorized entry shall be regarded as unlawful intrusion, and Mythag reserves the full right to exercise self-defense.\""
  },
  Stage_58988_Name = {
    Text = "Scholastic Decree"
  },
  Stage_59049_Desc = {
    Text = [[
