  },
  Stage_59077_Name = {
    Text = "Prime Fissure II"
  },
  Stage_59502_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Face your primordial despair. Face your primordial fear.
Stand beside each other unseen, and then conquer It.]]
  },
  Stage_59502_Name = {
    Text = "Decisive: Primal Shade"
  },
  Stage_59503_Desc = {
    Text = "To remember is your vow; to forget is your ritual."
  },
  Stage_59503_Name = {Text = "Rite"},
  Stage_59503_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59504_Desc = {
    Text = "Standing in the temple of dream, propping up the crumbling ruins.\nGuarding the speck of dust beneath you—the one that carries all your devotion and longing."
  },
  Stage_59504_Name = {
    Text = "Dream Fracture"
  },
  Stage_59504_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59505_Desc = {
    Text = "\"To survive, or to perish?\""
  },
  Stage_59505_Name = {Text = "Guide"},
  Stage_59505_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59506_Desc = {
    Text = "To remember is your vow; to forget is your ritual."
  },
  Stage_59506_Name = {Text = "Rite"},
  Stage_59506_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59507_Desc = {
    Text = "Standing in the temple of dream, propping up the crumbling ruins.\nGuarding the speck of dust beneath you—the one that carries all your devotion and longing."
  },
  Stage_59507_Name = {
    Text = "Dream Fracture"
  },
  Stage_59507_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59508_Desc = {
    Text = "\"To survive, or to perish?\""
  },
  Stage_59508_Name = {Text = "Guide"},
  Stage_59509_Desc = {
    Text = "\"To survive, or to perish?\""
  },
  Stage_59509_Name = {Text = "Guide"},
  Stage_59509_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_59510_Desc = {
    Text = "Standing in the temple of dream, propping up the crumbling ruins.\nGuarding the speck of dust beneath you—the one that carries all your devotion and longing."
  },
  Stage_59510_Name = {
    Text = "Dream Fracture"
  },
  Stage_59511_Desc = {
    Text = "To remember is your vow; to forget is your ritual."
  },
  Stage_59511_Name = {Text = "Rite"},
  Stage_62348_Desc = {
    Text = "This is the crescendo of the stars. This is the final curtain of the cosmos.\nIn this profound silence, listen carefully—\ncan you hear the true notes?"
  },
  Stage_62348_Name = {Text = "Finale"},
  Stage_66016_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It is the Supreme Will, the Creator of the universe, and the Ender of all things.
Wail before It. For your frail courage, for Its boundless Authorities.]]
  },
  Stage_66016_Name = {
    Text = "Workhouse: Gaze of Sorrow"
  },
  Stage_66016_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66017_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He is the Supreme Will, the Creator of the universe, and the Ender of all things.
Wail before Him. For your frail courage, for His boundless authority.]]
  },
  Stage_66017_Name = {
    Text = "Workhouse: Vision of Lament"
  },
  Stage_66017_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66018_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He is the Supreme Will, the Creator of the universe, and the Ender of all things.
Wail before Him. For your frail courage, for His boundless authority.]]
  },
  Stage_66018_Name = {
    Text = "Workhouse: Vision of Lament"
  },
  Stage_66381_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Do not worry, for fear is the most primal instinct of living beings. 
The Divine never troubles even a single ant. It blesses you with awakening.]]
  },
  Stage_66381_Name = {
    Text = "Wax Museum: Vision of Fear"
  },
  Stage_66381_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66382_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sing, sing of our great Creator!
When It dreams, the living prosper.
When It opens Its eyes, all things turn to dust.]]
  },
  Stage_66382_Name = {
    Text = "Bridgeport: Vision of Heresy"
  },
  Stage_66382_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66383_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Feel the pain; feel the most primal gift of the Supreme Will. 
Through pain, you may glimpse the majesty of the Creator.]]
  },
  Stage_66383_Name = {
    Text = "Rye: Vision of Chills"
  },
  Stage_66383_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66384_Desc = {
    Text = [[
There is no need to struggle. There is no need to resist. Why attempt to comprehend the incomprehensible?
Under the gaze of the Supreme Will, let us embrace the end of the dream.]]
  },
  Stage_66384_Name = {
    Text = "Sanatorium: Vision of Enigma"
  },
  Stage_66384_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_66385_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It is the Supreme Will, the Creator of the universe, and the Ender of all things.
Wail before It. For your frail courage, for Its boundless Authorities.]]
  },
  Stage_66385_Name = {
    Text = "Workhouse: Vision of Lament"
  },
  Stage_66385_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67123_Desc = {
    Text = "That magnificent civilization, those joys and sorrows of the human world, the countless people around you who have come and went—have never existed. The dissolution of dreams shall ultimately arrive.\nForget, Keeper. Oblivion is the grandest of sufferings.\nOblivion is the remedy of supreme bliss."
  },
  Stage_67123_Name = {
    Text = "Remouahe: Vision of Birth"
  },
  Stage_67123_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67124_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Upon the torrent of blind folly, the tower of order collapses.
Rationality has never existed; only madness is your destiny.]]
  },
  Stage_67124_Name = {
    Text = "Sona-Nyl: Vision of Madness"
  },
  Stage_67124_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67897_Desc = {
    Text = [[
