  },
  Stage_67903_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67904_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Feel the pain; feel the most primal gift of the Supreme Will. 
Through pain, you may glimpse the majesty of the Creator.]]
  },
  Stage_67904_Name = {
    Text = "Rye: Gaze of Scathe"
  },
  Stage_67904_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67905_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sing, sing of our great Creator!
When He dreams, the living prosper.
When He opens His eyes, all things turn to dust.]]
  },
  Stage_67905_Name = {
    Text = "Bridgeport: Vision of Heresy"
  },
  Stage_67905_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67906_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Upon the torrent of blind folly, the tower of order collapses.
Rationality has never existed; only madness is your destiny.]]
  },
  Stage_67906_Name = {
    Text = "Sona-Nyl: Vision of Madness"
  },
  Stage_67906_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67907_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Feel the pain; feel the most primal gift of the Supreme Will. 
Through pain, you may glimpse the majesty of the Creator.]]
  },
  Stage_67907_Name = {
    Text = "Rye: Vision of Chills"
  },
  Stage_67907_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67908_Desc = {
    Text = [[
There is no need to struggle. There is no need to resist. Why attempt to comprehend the incomprehensible?
Under the gaze of the Supreme Will, let us embrace the end of the dream.]]
  },
  Stage_67908_Name = {
    Text = "Sanatorium: Vision of Enigma"
  },
  Stage_67908_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67909_Desc = {
    Text = [[
There is no need to struggle. There is no need to resist. Why attempt to comprehend the incomprehensible?
Under the gaze of the Supreme Will, let us embrace the end of the dream.]]
  },
  Stage_67909_Name = {
    Text = "Sanatorium: Gaze of Deceit"
  },
  Stage_67909_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67910_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Do not worry, for fear is the most primal instinct of living beings. 
God never troubles even a single ant. He blesses you with awakening.]]
  },
  Stage_67910_Name = {
    Text = "Wax Museum: Vision of Fear"
  },
  Stage_67910_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67911_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Upon the torrent of blind folly, the tower of order collapses.
Rationality has never existed; only madness is your destiny.]]
  },
  Stage_67911_Name = {
    Text = "Sona-Nyl: Gaze of Madness"
  },
  Stage_67911_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67912_Desc = {
    Text = "That magnificent civilization, those joys and sorrows of the human world, the countless people around you who have come and went—have never existed. The dissolution of dreams shall ultimately arrive.\nForget, Keeper. Oblivion is the grandest of sufferings.\nOblivion is the remedy of supreme bliss."
  },
  Stage_67912_Name = {
    Text = "Remouahe: Gaze of Birth"
  },
  Stage_67912_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67913_Desc = {
    Text = [[
To ants, life and death have never been a concern.
They are born to struggle against the inevitable.]]
  },
  Stage_67913_Name = {Text = "Ant"},
  Stage_67913_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_67914_Desc = {
    Text = [[
{Male=His,Female=Her} name and deeds will be known by none. {Male=He,Female=She} came from oblivion, and to oblivion {Male=he,Female=she} returns. Only the epitaph on {Male=his,Female=her} tombstone will endure through the ages.
The Silver Key once guided {Male=his,Female=her} path. May it also guide you and me on our future road.]]
  },
  Stage_67914_Name = {
    Text = "Farewell: K-0617"
  },
