  },
  Stage_70107_Name = {
    Text = "Budding Hope: Murmurs: Madness"
  },
  Stage_70107_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_70108_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The regenerated flower is an eternal cycle.
At the height of life, do not forget: the secrets of day and night and the whispers of the seasons will fade with the falling petals.
To end in death is to begin in birth.]]
  },
  Stage_70108_Name = {
    Text = "Bloom's Renewal: Murmurs Part VI"
  },
