  },
  Stage_70402_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The black cat is lost in the moment, emitting cryptic murmurs from deep in its throat, as though all the truths of the world converge here.
Meow. Mrow. Mrrowr.
You understand nothing, save for the urge to silence its incessant chatter.]]
  },
  Stage_70402_Name = {
    Text = "Cat's Whisper: Part I"
  },
  Stage_70403_Desc = {
    Text = [[
