  },
  Stage_70411_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Ears spinning, paws flourishing, tail erect.
In the cha-cha it shares with you, the cat's delight is plain for all to see.]]
  },
  Stage_70411_Name = {
    Text = "Cat's Joy: Part I"
  },
  Stage_70412_Desc = {
    Text = "The cat's paws probe ceaselessly before you—extend, retract, extend, retract.\nPitch-black paw prints press into the leather of your school shoes.\nYou cannot help but raise a fist the size of a cooking pot."
  },
  Stage_70412_Name = {
    Text = "Cat's Pawprints: Part I"
  },
  Stage_70413_Desc = {
    Text = "The familiar black cat evidently retains its memories of you, and tips its top hat in greeting.\nA white glove, appeared from nowhere, lands at your feet—this is no salutation, but a gentleman's invitation to duel."
  },
  Stage_70413_Name = {
    Text = "Cat's Greeting: Part I"
  },
  Stage_70414_Desc = {
