  },
  Stage_70924_Desc = {
    Text = "Dear, let us go witness the end of days.\nRather than wither in despair, seize what time remains before fate descends—and forge the great work of the end with our own hands."
  },
  Stage_70924_Name = {
    Text = "Path Untaken"
  },
  Stage_70925_Desc = {
    Text = "Numbers have never been names—merely symbols.\nMediocre lives cling to their illusory uniqueness, and so resist being reduced to a number.\nYet she never cared."
  },
  Stage_70926_Desc = {
    Text = "Possibility does not promise a good ending, yet mirages are bait enough for those who press onward."
  },
  Stage_70926_Name = {
    Text = "Answer of Maybes"
  },
  Stage_70927_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Gurgle, gurgle, gurgle. Organs let out desperate cries of thirst.
It's not the hunger in the stomach; the emptiness originates from the brain.]]
  },
  Stage_70927_Name = {
    Text = "Mortal Sustenance"
  },
  Stage_70928_Desc = {
    Text = "Rain. Unceasing rain."
  },
  Stage_70928_Name = {
    Text = "Within the Rain"
  },
  Stage_70929_Desc = {
    Text = "Step by step by step, His tendrils probe into the bottommost depths of the deep dream."
  },
  Stage_70929_Name = {Text = "Deep Dream"},
  Stage_70930_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Eyes, I dare not meet in dreams
Within the fantastical realm of death.]]
  },
  Stage_70930_Name = {Text = "Hollow One"},
  Stage_70931_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humanity decrees that there can only be a single truth.
That which you behold is the true face of the world.]]
  },
  Stage_70931_Name = {Text = "The Truth"},
  Stage_70932_Desc = {
    Text = "Look—how enticing that smooth, glossy apple is.\nTake one delicate bite, and let go of all your worries."
  },
  Stage_70932_Name = {
    Text = "Poisoned Apple"
  },
  Stage_70933_Desc = {
    Text = "Everything is exactly as it was in memory."
  },
  Stage_70933_Name = {
    Text = "Kind and Brave"
  },
  Stage_70934_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What has passed will not return.
Unless it is in another world.]]
  },
  Stage_70934_Name = {
    Text = "That Which We Lost"
  },
  Stage_70935_Desc = {
    Text = "Backbeat, backbeat—the notes drift beyond the bounds of anticipated rhythm."
  },
  Stage_70935_Name = {
    Text = "Enigma's Cadence"
  },
  Stage_70936_Desc = {
    Text = "Escape one trap, only to enter an even larger cage."
  },
  Stage_70936_Name = {Text = "Escape"},
  Stage_70937_Desc = {
    Text = "Does the Brain in a Vat dream of Mechanical Prosthetics?"
  },
  Stage_70937_Name = {
    Text = "Dream in a Vat"
  },
  Stage_71748_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Hush—guess what I saw through your eyes?\"\nAfter the Keeper frightened Aurita to tears, Lotan nearly tore down the fourth wall of the Keeper's room, because Aurita's crying was just too unsettling."
  },
  Stage_71748_Name = {
    Text = "The Fourth Wall: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71748_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71749_Desc = {
    Text = "Do not bombard the audience's mind at every moment; leave them space to think—ideally, leave them in complete stillness. If only Doll could apply this during class, the Keeper murmured, and everyone agreed."
  },
  Stage_71749_Name = {
    Text = "Quiet Instant: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71749_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71750_Desc = {
    Text = "At a story's end, a character must show growth or transformation. Yet in life, the arc has a way of bending back into a circle."
  },
  Stage_71750_Name = {
    Text = "Arc's Theorem: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71750_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71751_Desc = {
    Text = "A scene set in advance, a handful of familiar actors. The rest is up to inspiration and interaction."
  },
  Stage_71751_Name = {
    Text = "Masked Farce: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71751_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71752_Desc = {
    Text = "This is a word even Ramona hadn't heard. With the aid of some elderly Awakeners, everyone finally came to understand: sometimes, a good cry is the only remedy for a troubled spirit."
  },
  Stage_71752_Name = {
    Text = "Catharsis: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71752_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71753_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"Do not let the audience lose themselves entirely in the story; compel them to analyze and critique what unfolds on stage."
On this theory, Aurita had the following to say: Aurita doesn't want to be scolded by anyone! Aurita just wants to be friends with everyone!]]
  },
  Stage_71753_Name = {
    Text = "Distancing Effect: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71753_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71754_Desc = {
    Text = "A sudden twist, an unexpected turn, a shift in the story—the Keeper cannot help but feel that this, at times, describes themselves."
  },
  Stage_71754_Name = {
    Text = "Plot Rotation: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71754_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71755_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The theoretical book Casiah found states: the time of the story cannot exceed one day, and the stage cannot exceed one location...
The Keeper gave up reading this. After all, sometimes even one day is not enough for completing a post-class assignment paper on "Dissolution and Cataclysm Prevention".]]
  },
  Stage_71755_Name = {
    Text = "Classical Unities: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71755_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71756_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The theoretical volume found by Casiah reads: the pyramid model concerns itself with the resolution of a crisis.
Yet not every crisis finds resolution in reality. They are concealed beneath the illusion of peace, festering in the dark, until they erupt into a new "pyramid."]]
  },
  Stage_71756_Name = {
    Text = "Drama's Apex: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71756_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Origin"},
  Stage_71810_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She has many identities: socialite, merchant, broker, collector...
but never herself. Regrettably, Lady Rose never mourned this.
To her, the raw and unrefined are beneath mention; complexity and murkiness are the pinnacle of taste.]]
  },
  Stage_71810_Name = {
    Text = "The Visage: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71810_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71811_Desc = {
    Text = "Her benefactor was unlike the others: he was made of mist.\nHaving long since lost faith in humanity, the girl found little distinction between a man made of mist and one made of gold or symbols.\nShe would pay for this misjudgment in time—but that is a story for much later."
  },
  Stage_71811_Name = {
    Text = "Daddy-Long-Legs: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71811_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71812_Desc = {
    Text = "Before departing, the biographer looked back at the rose-covered mansion—it was not a ten-thousandth of its owner's radiance.\nThe legend of Lady Sorel continues, unfolding at this very moment. We will all bear witness."
  },
  Stage_71812_Name = {
    Text = "Finale: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71812_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71813_Desc = {
    Text = "Flower arranging, embroidery, the tea ceremony—her life is a string of meaningless symbols.\n\"Good morning, Miss Sorel.\" \"You are wonderful, Miss Sorel.\"—\nThose feigned cheerful voices are like the glass of a thick fishbowl, enclosing her forever."
  },
  Stage_71813_Name = {
    Text = "Cauldron's Depths: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71813_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71814_Desc = {
    Text = "Beauty is an invisible thread that binds hearts with ease. She plucks at it casually, like the most nonchalant genius.\nShe tires of the game soon enough—for through their grotesque faces, she glimpses herself."
  },
  Stage_71814_Name = {
    Text = "Puppet's Play: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71814_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71815_Desc = {
    Text = "On her birthday, she received a gift: a white silk dress, meticulously sewn.\nThen she was told she would wear this gift and become one herself—her parents' offering to another."
  },
  Stage_71815_Name = {
    Text = "A Gift: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71815_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71816_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She draws every gaze to herself like a magnet.
Envious, astonished, resentful, covetous... but never calm. Much like the fate that awaits her.]]
  },
  Stage_71816_Name = {
    Text = "The Gaze: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71816_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71817_Desc = {
    Text = "That night, she dreamed of black mist—alive, trembling.\nNot an indescribable hybrid of tiger and horse, yet bearing the nature of both.\nAnd at once a black cat, a rose, a storm."
  },
  Stage_71817_Name = {
    Text = "Rose's Nook: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71817_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71818_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She will follow the script, performing one act after another, stirring endless chaos.
She is the dancer who takes flight at the eye of the storm.
She has always been the most dedicated performers.]]
  },
  Stage_71818_Name = {
    Text = "Unfinished Script: Part VII"
  },
  Stage_71818_StageInitStateText = {Text = "Breeding"},
  Stage_71852_Desc = {
    Text = "He sat upon the high bluestone throne, alone in his eternal majesty and solitude."
  },
  Stage_71852_Name = {Text = "Throne"},
  Stage_71853_Desc = {
    Text = "With my own hands, I shall place it upon my head—that infinite power and glory."
  },
  Stage_71853_Name = {Text = "Coronation"},
  Stage_71854_Desc = {
    Text = "Humanity, small as it is, has no recourse but to pray for miracles from the gods."
  },
  Stage_71854_Name = {Text = "Calamity"},
  Stage_71855_Desc = {
    Text = "The weight of that crown had long since pressed upon those children."
  },
  Stage_71855_Name = {Text = "Childhood"},
  Stage_71923_Desc = {
    Text = "From out of the abyss emerges darkness; intruders writhe amidst heart-seizing terror before being devoured by the darkness."
  },
  Stage_71923_Name = {
    Text = "D-Effect Zone: Wave 2: Alert V"
  },
  Stage_71924_Desc = {
    Text = "From out of the abyss emerges darkness; intruders writhe amidst heart-seizing terror before being devoured by the darkness."
  },
  Stage_71924_Name = {
