  Stage_71932_Name = {
    Text = "D-Effect Zone: Wave 2: Alert V"
  },
  Stage_72063_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Eyes, I dare not meet in dreams
Within the fantastical realm of death.]]
  },
  Stage_72063_Name = {Text = "Hollow One"},
  Stage_72064_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humanity decrees that there can only be a single truth.
That which you behold is the true face of the world.]]
  },
  Stage_72064_Name = {Text = "The Truth"},
  Stage_72065_Desc = {
    Text = "Look—how enticing that smooth, glossy apple is.\nTake one delicate bite, and let go of all your worries."
  },
  Stage_72065_Name = {
    Text = "Poisoned Apple"
  },
  Stage_72066_Desc = {
    Text = "Everything is exactly as it was in memory."
  },
  Stage_72066_Name = {
    Text = "Kind and Brave"
  },
  Stage_72067_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What has passed will not return.
Unless it is in another world.]]
  },
  Stage_72067_Name = {
    Text = "That Which We Lost"
  },
  Stage_72068_Desc = {
    Text = "Backbeat, backbeat—the notes drift beyond the bounds of anticipated rhythm."
  },
  Stage_72068_Name = {
    Text = "Enigma's Cadence"
  },
  Stage_72069_Desc = {
    Text = "Escape one trap, only to enter an even larger cage."
  },
  Stage_72069_Name = {Text = "Escape"},
  Stage_72070_Desc = {
    Text = "Dear, let us go witness the end of days.\nRather than wither in despair, seize what time remains before fate descends—and forge the great work of the end with our own hands."
  },
  Stage_72070_Name = {
    Text = "Path Untaken"
  },
  Stage_72071_Desc = {
    Text = "Numbers have never been names—merely symbols.\nMediocre lives cling to their illusory uniqueness, and so resist being reduced to a number.\nYet she never cared."
  },
  Stage_72072_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Gurgle, gurgle, gurgle. Organs let out desperate cries of thirst.
It's not the hunger in the stomach; the emptiness originates from the brain.]]
  },
  Stage_72072_Name = {
    Text = "Mortal Sustenance"
  },
  Stage_74229_Desc = {
    Text = "You encounter that billowing hem by chance—the spinning skirt so like the wings of a swan in flight, and yet so like a flame."
  },
  Stage_74229_Name = {
    Text = "Serendipitous Flames"
  },
  Stage_74230_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Should this not be a temple of art? How else to explain so many dazzling, elegant movements.
But is it truly a temple of art? Then what explains all those cold, oleaginous gazes?]]
  },
  Stage_74230_Name = {
    Text = "Burning Ice"
  },
  Stage_74231_Desc = {
    Text = "The swan in the dream soars high, then crashes into the hunter's net."
  },
  Stage_74231_Name = {
    Text = "A Midsummer Night's Dream"
  },
  Stage_74232_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The azure dancer moves across the stage.
The azure flames burn within the fire.
A final elegy, offered to the swan that met death with grace.]]
  },
  Stage_74232_Name = {
    Text = "Swan's Elegy"
  },
  Stage_74242_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The azure dancer moves across the stage.
The azure flames burn within the fire.
A final elegy, offered to the swan that met death with grace.]]
  },
  Stage_74242_Name = {
    Text = "Swan's Elegy"
  },
  Stage_74243_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The azure dancer moves across the stage.
The azure flames burn within the fire.
A final elegy, offered to the swan that met death with grace.]]
  },
  Stage_74243_Name = {
    Text = "Swan's Elegy"
  },
  Stage_74328_Desc = {
    Text = "The conditions are set. The blood runs hot. Now, the duel begins."
  },
  Stage_74328_Name = {
    Text = "Duel of Will"
  },
  Stage_74329_Desc = {
    Text = "Never lose hope in despair. Any moment may become the turning point that reverses everything."
  },
  Stage_74329_Name = {
    Text = "Cosmos Reforged"
  },
  Stage_74330_Desc = {
    Text = "An unexpected incident has brought a special visitor to the Traphase space. To reclaim it, you embark on a journey to become the greatest Card Master."
  },
  Stage_74330_Name = {
    Text = "Outlander's Visit"
  },
  Stage_74975_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"It is the One. It is the All. It is the hope which opens the gate of Truth."
Countless keys formed a circle. They fall from the heavens, bringing humanity a heavy hope.
And heavy graves.]]
  },
  Stage_74975_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive VI"
  },
