  Stage_75748_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It had long forgotten its own name, and even the memory of the day it first met her was beginning to blur.
Only those hands, those hands that gently held it, always warmed its wild and lonely soul.
So it took the beautiful head from her hands, willingly donned the eternal mask and shackles.]]
  },
  Stage_75748_Name = {
    Text = "She and It: Part I"
  },
  Stage_75749_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Rainy days always make it hard to breathe.
The slippery moisture clings to the skin, and the oppressive air fills the lungs.
<Italic:Clatter>... something falls and rolls.
Be careful, don't let it trip you.]]
  },
