  Stage_7647_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive I"
  },
  Stage_7648_Desc = {
    Text = "It pursues transgressors without pause.\nAs for what constitutes \"rules,\" and what constitutes \"breaking\" them?\nThe hound never thinks—it would only slow the chase."
  },
  Stage_7648_Name = {
    Text = "Shadow Beyond III"
  },
  Stage_7649_Desc = {
    Text = "Londinium is renowned for its resplendent industrial civilization and the leaden fog that shrouds the city.\nThe fog is omnipresent—to passersby, little more than an incidental, meaningless inconvenience."
  },
  Stage_7649_Name = {
    Text = "City of Big Smoke II"
  },
  Stage_7650_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_7650_Name = {
    Text = "Caro Marsh: Fissure Ⅶ"
  },
  Stage_7651_Desc = {
    Text = "A crude, undigested mass. People call it excrement—or chaos.\nThe world was born from excrement."
  },
  Stage_7651_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Cluster V"
  },
  Stage_7652_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Wriggling, seeping... The protoplasmic mass slips through the fissures of its shackles.
This is the price she pays for "freedom."]]
  },
  Stage_7652_Name = {
    Text = "Chain of Darkness III"
  },
  Stage_7653_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Gate\" is about to open, revealing a glimpse of the truth.\nIt's neither black nor white—truth is chromatic yet murky."
  },
  Stage_7653_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Rotation Gap I"
  },
  Stage_7654_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Gate\" is about to open, revealing a glimpse of the truth.\nIt's neither black nor white—truth is chromatic yet murky."
  },
  Stage_7654_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Rotation Gap I"
  },
  Stage_7655_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Gate\" is about to open, revealing a glimpse of the truth.\nIt's neither black nor white—truth is chromatic yet murky."
  },
  Stage_7655_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Rotation Gap I"
  },
  Stage_7656_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It leans against the bedside in docile repose, its dull button eyes fixed upon the void.
The small body has borne all its owner's tears, yet cannot offer a single word of solace.]]
  },
  Stage_7656_Name = {
    Text = "Tears of the Doll V"
  },
  Stage_7657_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They were an unconscious amalgam of sorrow, distortion, and naivety,
dressed up as joyful children, adults, and pets.
Having never tasted happiness, they became the worst actors of all.]]
  },
  Stage_7657_Name = {
    Text = "Sculpted Secrets V"
  },
  Stage_7658_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The "Gate" has been opened. The illusion nears its end.
Hush... Do not look. Do not listen.]]
  },
  Stage_7658_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Fissure IV"
  },
  Stage_7659_Desc = {
    Text = "The tempest still brews. It is not yet over."
  },
  Stage_7659_Name = {
    Text = "Reality Reboot"
  },
  Stage_7660_Desc = {
    Text = "No lavish scenery, no captivating heroine.\n—Only a tedious play performed by three men."
  },
  Stage_7660_Name = {
    Text = "Guide, Mage, Thrall"
  },
  Stage_7661_Desc = {
    Text = "Into the wind and sands, the warrior charges toward the sun without hesitation."
  },
  Stage_7661_Name = {
    Text = "Solar Expedition"
  },
  Stage_7662_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Friends, lay down your quarrels and strife.
The sacrificial flames have risen. Savor this final peace before death.]]
  },
  Stage_7662_Name = {
    Text = "Vermilion Rite"
  },
  Stage_7663_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Strictly speaking, this is not a tragedy.
The word "tragedy" has no place in a warrior's lexicon.]]
  },
  Stage_7663_Name = {
    Text = "Tragedy's Curtain"
  },
  Stage_7664_Desc = {
    Text = "Sail towards land—towards a glimmer of hope."
  },
  Stage_7664_Name = {
    Text = "Tragic Embarkation"
  },
  Stage_7665_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curved horizon hidden in the depths of the cosmos.
It leads you from one darkness into another.]]
  },
  Stage_7665_Name = {
    Text = "Schwarzschild Throat III"
  },
  Stage_7666_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Gate\" is about to open, revealing a glimpse of the truth.\nIt's neither black nor white—truth is chromatic yet murky."
  },
