Yes... Yes, only my God is the true Him.]]
  },
  Stage_7827_Name = {Text = "Lost Light"},
  Stage_7830_Desc = {
    Text = "Here lies buried a university, shattered and scarred, drained of all strength\nOnce, it courageously offered a faint glimmer of hope for the survival of humanity\nAs for its fate—you can see it before you now."
  },
  Stage_7830_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive V"
  },
