  },
  Stage_7834_Name = {Text = "Malady"},
  Stage_7835_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Scalpels, disappearances, and death await those who wander
within the dense mist shrouding the Workhouse.]]
  },
  Stage_7835_Name = {
    Text = "Who killed Cock Robin"
  },
  Stage_7836_Desc = {
    Text = "His dominion is the shell of the cosmos, and His desires know no bounds."
  },
  Stage_7836_Name = {
    Text = "Worm's Den V"
  },
  Stage_7837_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You and Ramona head to Lilian's Workhouse, located in the eastern district of
Londinium for your first investigation as a new Keeper.
Everything will go smoothly, right?]]
  },
  Stage_7837_Name = {
    Text = "Looks Deceive"
  },
  Stage_7838_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sweet, rich, cherished by children.
Elegant, sublime, coveted by adults.]]
  },
  Stage_7838_Name = {
    Text = "Saccharine Art"
  },
  Stage_7839_Desc = {
    Text = "The weight of conscience can be as heavy as a solemn vow."
  },
  Stage_7839_Name = {
    Text = "Burden of Conscience"
  },
  Stage_7840_Desc = {
    Text = "Danger comes from within."
  },
  Stage_7840_Name = {
    Text = "Inner Peril"
  },
  Stage_7841_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh how I wish I could never grow up, so I could spend every night stargazing with you.
Oh how I wish I could grow up faster, so I could protect all of you.]]
  },
  Stage_7841_Name = {Text = "Our Secret"},
  Stage_7842_Desc = {
    Text = "Cut the strings on the puppet, and she will never dance again."
  },
  Stage_7842_Name = {
    Text = "Birdless Night"
  },
  Stage_7843_Desc = {
    Text = "All you seek lies before your eyes. You have simply never perceived it."
  },
  Stage_7843_Name = {
    Text = "Beneath the Brim"
  },
  Stage_7844_Desc = {
    Text = "Ramona rejoined the team. The Mythag Investigator's journey continues."
  },
  Stage_7844_Name = {
    Text = "Yesterday Again"
  },
  Stage_7845_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Human legs cannot outpace the agility of wild quadrupeds, but their mind can.
However, after capturing the "Hellhound," what awaits you next?]]
  },
  Stage_7845_Name = {
    Text = "Ace up My Sleeve"
  },
  Stage_7846_Desc = {
    Text = "Wishing you a pleasant journey."
  },
  Stage_7846_Name = {Text = "Bon Voyage"},
  Stage_7847_Desc = {
    Text = "In the subway, you were attacked by a mysterious assassin..."
  },
  Stage_7847_Name = {
    Text = "The Friendless"
  },
  Stage_7848_Desc = {
    Text = "Interactions with the Lady Daffodil are always transactional. Lady Daffodil appears and proposes a deal, but will the mysterious attacker accept this transaction?"
  },
  Stage_7848_Name = {Text = "Fair Trade"},
  Stage_7849_Desc = {
    Text = "Following rumors of the hellhound \"Cerberus,\" Mythag investigators arrive at the outskirts of a small town called Rye near Londinium, looking to uncover the mystery behind the disappearances..."
  },
  Stage_7849_Name = {
    Text = "Think Before You Act"
  },
  Stage_7850_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Good news and bad news. Lost clues won't reappear, but new cases are brewing in the shadows.
Believe it, the investigators won't come up empty-handed again.]]
  },
  Stage_7850_Name = {
    Text = "Good News, Bad News"
  },
  Stage_7851_Desc = {
    Text = "A frenzied tone; a bloody stench—this is the welcome ceremony of Rye."
  },
  Stage_7851_Name = {
    Text = "Welcome to Rye"
  },
  Stage_7852_Desc = {
    Text = [[
It leans against the bedside in docile repose, its dull button eyes fixed upon the void.
The small body has borne all its owner's tears, yet cannot offer a single word of solace.]]
  },
  Stage_7852_Name = {
    Text = "Tears of the Doll III"
  },
  Stage_7855_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He cannot be Him, and He can never be him.
Yes... Yes, only my God is the true Him.]]
  },
  Stage_7855_Name = {Text = "Lost Light"},
  Stage_7856_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They existed long before the stars were born.
They are both illusion and everything.]]
  },
  Stage_7856_Name = {
    Text = "Chaotic Residue IV"
  },
  Stage_7857_Desc = {
    Text = "They guard the ocean's secrets in silence; their souls as fathomless as the cosmos."
  },
  Stage_7857_Name = {
    Text = "Abyssal Residue II"
  },
  Stage_7858_Desc = {
    Text = "How can a sunset endure forever?"
  },
  Stage_7858_Name = {Text = "Sunset"},
  Stage_7859_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When the rain descends and blood surges forth, the moment of reunion arrives.
It has been a long time, Keeper.]]
  },
  Stage_7859_Name = {
    Text = "Serendipity"
  },
  Stage_7860_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They drift like inscrutable sorcerers through the interstices of time and space.
No hatred, no fear, no mercy.]]
  },
  Stage_7860_Name = {
    Text = "Cosmic Residue I"
  },
  Stage_7861_Desc = {
    Text = "It pursues transgressors without pause.\nAs for what constitutes \"rules,\" and what constitutes \"breaking\" them?\nThe hound never thinks—it would only slow the chase."
  },
  Stage_7861_Name = {
    Text = "Shadow Beyond IV"
  },
  Stage_7862_Desc = {
    Text = "They guard the ocean's secrets in silence; their souls as fathomless as the cosmos."
  },
  Stage_7862_Name = {
    Text = "Abyssal Residue III"
  },
  Stage_7863_Desc = {
    Text = "They guard the ocean's secrets in silence; their souls as fathomless as the cosmos."
  },
  Stage_7863_Name = {
    Text = "Abyssal Residue I"
  },
  Stage_7864_Desc = {
    Text = "Londinium is renowned for its resplendent industrial civilization and the leaden fog that shrouds the city.\nThe fog is omnipresent—to passersby, little more than an incidental, meaningless inconvenience."
  },
  Stage_7864_Name = {
    Text = "City of Big Smoke I"
  },
  Stage_7865_Desc = {
    Text = "What blinded her eyes?\nLove, pity, justice—or an excess of gratitude?"
  },
  Stage_7865_Name = {
    Text = "Transcendence"
  },
  Stage_7866_Desc = {
    Text = "The child reaches out to her mother, begging for an embrace filled with pain.\nEven as the injection needle pierces her tender skin, the scalpel cuts through her pale flesh, and the restraints bind her fragile joints.\nThe growing, endless pain still cannot stop their embrace.\nFor this is the warmest embrace—from the moment the embryo left her mother's womb, estrangement grows; sharpness is honed; and mutual harm ensues—ultimately returning to intimacy, merging into one."
  },
  Stage_7866_Name = {Text = "She"},
  Stage_7867_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You sleep in the stillness of the night, with no doubts or disputes remaining;
like an eternal embrace, we rest in tranquil peace.]]
  },
  Stage_7867_Name = {Text = "Room"},
  Stage_7868_Desc = {
    Text = "Lilies bloom across the snowy plains."
  },
  Stage_7868_Name = {
    Text = "Mystic River"
  },
  Stage_7869_Desc = {
    Text = "Dawn always comes. The sun invariably rises."
  },
  Stage_7869_Name = {Text = "Epilogue"},
  Stage_7870_Desc = {
    Text = "She bears the sacred relic within her own flesh, shepherds the faithful with doctrine, and disseminates belief through venomous fangs."
  },
  Stage_7870_Name = {
    Text = "Grasp of Piety II"
  },
  Stage_7871_Desc = {
    Text = "Sharp spines pierced through the previously flawless arc—what emerged from the rift was something other than \"Cerberus\"."
  },
  Stage_7871_Name = {
    Text = "Cracked Carapace"
  },
  Stage_7872_Desc = {
    Text = "Reality sows the seeds of ruin, while destiny guides the encounter."
  },
  Stage_7872_Name = {
    Text = "Fate's Seed"
  },
  Stage_78738_Name = {
    Text = "Tulu: Godking Trial"
  },
  Stage_7873_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They twist and merge in the dark, then are carefully preserved within the idols.
This is a premeditated reunion.]]
  },
  Stage_7873_Name = {
    Text = "Aequor Legacy: Fissure V"
  },
  Stage_7874_Desc = {
    Text = "On a ship, who else is worthy of trust but the captain?"
  },
  Stage_7874_Name = {
    Text = "Crew Member"
  },
  Stage_7875_Desc = {
    Text = "Apostle of the Seas."
  },
  Stage_7875_Name = {Text = "Apostle"},
  Stage_7876_Desc = {
    Text = "Traversing across the many seas—besides enemies, perhaps there may also be a glimmer of hope."
  },
  Stage_7876_Name = {
    Text = "The Indulgent"
  },
  Stage_78773_Name = {
    Text = "Murphy: Fauxborn Trial"
  },
  Stage_7877_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They were an unconscious amalgam of sorrow, distortion, and naivety,
dressed up as joyful children, adults, and pets.
Having never tasted happiness, they became the worst actors of all.]]
  },
  Stage_7877_Name = {
    Text = "Sculpted Secrets II"
  },
  Stage_7878_Desc = {
    Text = "The port at night, the simple residents, and their warm hospitality."
  },
  Stage_7878_Name = {
    Text = "Ambushed From All Sides"
  },
  Stage_7879_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_7879_Name = {
    Text = "Caro Marsh: Fissure Ⅷ"
