  Stage_7960_Desc = {
    Text = "What a blissful slumber—it brings my angel back to me."
  },
  Stage_7960_Name = {
    Text = "Secret Window"
  },
  Stage_7961_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Diaries are fragments of memory.
Diaries are always discovered during investigations.]]
  },
  Stage_7961_Name = {
    Text = "Memory Fragments"
  },
  Stage_7962_Desc = {
    Text = "Lilies bloom across the snowy plains."
  },
  Stage_7962_Name = {Text = "28 Days"},
  Stage_7963_Desc = {
    Text = "When the nobles lose their power and the wealthy lose their fortunes, they are rendered helpless—just as you are now."
  },
  Stage_7963_Name = {
    Text = "Cuckoo's Asylum"
  },
  Stage_7964_Desc = {
    Text = "A realm wrought for her—profound love and a terrifying cage, one and the same."
  },
  Stage_7964_Name = {Text = "Asylum"},
  Stage_7965_Desc = {
    Text = "Conflict is not confined to the battlefield. Sometimes it dwells in the utterances of the mad."
  },
  Stage_7965_Name = {
    Text = "Mouth of the Mad"
  },
  Stage_7966_Desc = {
    Text = "The silent flame makes hollow promises to those who pass."
  },
  Stage_7966_Name = {
    Text = "Moth-Trapping Fire"
  },
  Stage_7967_Desc = {
    Text = "Trails entwined in the mist, countless footsteps wandering upon them—each step an inquiry addressed to fate."
  },
  Stage_7967_Name = {
    Text = "Path Astray"
  },
  Stage_7968_Desc = {
    Text = "It pursues transgressors without pause.\nAs for what constitutes \"rules,\" and what constitutes \"breaking\" them?\nThe hound never thinks—it would only slow the chase."
  },
  Stage_7968_Name = {
    Text = "Shadow Beyond I"
  },
  Stage_7969_Desc = {
    Text = "She bears the sacred relic within her own flesh, shepherds the faithful with doctrine, and disseminates belief through venomous fangs."
  },
  Stage_7969_Name = {
    Text = "Grasp of Piety I"
  },
  Stage_7970_Desc = {
    Text = "The tempest still brews. It is not yet over."
  },
  Stage_7970_Name = {
    Text = "Reality Reboot"
  },
  Stage_7971_Desc = {
    Text = "That was not a being that was ever desired; merely a filthy parasite."
  },
  Stage_7971_Name = {Text = "Parasite"},
  Stage_7972_Desc = {
    Text = "Sail towards land—towards a glimmer of hope."
  },
  Stage_7972_Name = {
    Text = "Tragic Embarkation"
  },
  Stage_7973_Desc = {
    Text = "The night is eroded by undercurrents, and the stars fall silent. The crisis moon, fraught with twists and storms, quietly reflects an unknown future."
  },
  Stage_7973_Name = {
    Text = "Crisis Moon"
  },
  Stage_7974_Desc = {
    Text = "Chasing the alluring light within the endless darkness of night, like a moth drawn to a flame; soaring toward the flames of destiny, heedless of all else."
  },
  Stage_7974_Name = {Text = "Pyre Moth"},
  Stage_7975_Desc = {
    Text = "Friendships that endured the passage of years have borne new hope."
  },
  Stage_7975_Name = {
    Text = "Old Bonds, New"
  },
  Stage_7976_Desc = {
    Text = "You may tremble and struggle in the stormy winds of fate, but you will never truly drift away."
  },
  Stage_7976_Name = {Text = "Precipice"},
  Stage_7977_Desc = {
    Text = "Into the wind and sands, the warrior charges toward the sun without hesitation."
  },
  Stage_7977_Name = {
    Text = "Solar Expedition"
  },
  Stage_7978_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Wriggling, seeping... The protoplasmic mass slips through the fissures of its shackles.
This is the price she pays for "freedom."]]
  },
  Stage_7978_Name = {
    Text = "Chain of Darkness V"
  },
  Stage_7979_Desc = {
    Text = "A crude, undigested mass. People call it excrement—or chaos.\nThe world was born from excrement."
  },
  Stage_7979_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Cluster III"
  },
  Stage_7980_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_7980_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Fissure Ⅷ"
  },
  Stage_7981_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They twist and merge in the dark, then are carefully preserved within the idols.
This is a premeditated reunion.]]
  },
  Stage_7981_Name = {
    Text = "Caro Marsh: Fissure V"
  },
  Stage_7982_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Then she vanished, consumed by the darkness.
People looked up, eyes wide, gazing at the sky she had traversed.]]
  },
  Stage_7982_Name = {Text = "Cedarwood"},
  Stage_7983_Desc = {
    Text = [[
One little mouse, one little mouse.
Run, run! She cut off its tail with a cleaver.]]
  },
  Stage_7983_Name = {
    Text = "Get 'em! Brown!"
  },
  Stage_7984_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You sleep in the stillness of the night, with no doubts or disputes remaining;
like an eternal embrace, we rest in tranquil peace.]]
  },
  Stage_7984_Name = {Text = "Room"},
  Stage_7985_Desc = {
    Text = "Londinium is renowned for its resplendent industrial civilization and the leaden fog that shrouds the city.\nThe fog is omnipresent—to passersby, little more than an incidental, meaningless inconvenience."
  },
  Stage_7985_Name = {
    Text = "City of Big Smoke III"
  },
  Stage_7986_Desc = {
    Text = "Upon the altar of her beauty, I offer my tears, my sighs, and my true heart."
  },
  Stage_7986_Name = {Text = "Galatea"},
  Stage_7987_Desc = {
    Text = "Crack—it splits.\nSnap—it breaks."
  },
  Stage_7987_Name = {Text = "Dollhouse"},
  Stage_7988_Desc = {
    Text = "Rules are meant to be broken, aren't they?"
  },
  Stage_7988_Name = {
    Text = "Three Rules"
