  Stage_8022_Desc = {
    Text = "That was not a being that was ever desired; merely a filthy parasite."
  },
  Stage_8022_Name = {Text = "Parasite"},
  Stage_8023_Desc = {
    Text = "What a blissful slumber—it brings my angel back to me."
  },
  Stage_8023_Name = {
    Text = "Secret Window"
  },
  Stage_80242_Desc = {
    Text = [[
At the story's end, the world still burns, and I am prepared to say farewell.
But we will meet again.]]
  },
  Stage_80242_Name = {
    Text = "Farewell, Burning World"
  },
  Stage_80243_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Humans are social animals, influenced by society while also influencing society.
So, tell me, what kind of self have you shaped under the influence of life and environment?]]
  },
  Stage_80243_Name = {
    Text = "Cognitive Reshaping"
  },
  Stage_80244_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Forgive me for having no gift to offer.
This small pupa is my deepest blessing to you: when you are trapped in despair, you must break free and be reborn.]]
  },
  Stage_80244_Name = {
    Text = "Pupa of Friendship"
  },
  Stage_80245_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Flames bring light, but also pain and harm.
When the whole world is ablaze, I am willing to turn my life into a single teardrop, merging into a sea of suffering.]]
  },
  Stage_80245_Name = {
    Text = "Hello, Burning World"
  },
  Stage_80246_Desc = {
    Text = "The hero is lonely; no human can truly reach him, and no dragon can truly understand him.\nTo slay the dragon, or to become the dragon—that is the question."
  },
  Stage_80246_Name = {
    Text = "Lone Champion"
  },
  Stage_80247_Desc = {
    Text = "I hold dreams for the world—hoping that flowers may forever bloom, hoping that smiles may forever last.\nYet life has granted me but a single dream."
  },
  Stage_80247_Name = {
    Text = "Myriad Dreams"
  },
  Stage_80248_Desc = {
    Text = "The collective is a fluid amber—each soul refracting the light of others, glimpsing its own reflection within a transparent cage."
  },
  Stage_80248_Name = {
    Text = "Social Animal"
  },
  Stage_80249_Desc = {
    Text = [[
I am my own ally and my own enemy.
This collaboration and carnage will not cease until only one remains.]]
  },
  Stage_80249_Name = {
    Text = "Doppelgänger"
  },
  Stage_8024_Desc = {
    Text = "However heavy the metal shell, the soul weighs a mere 21 grams."
  },
  Stage_8024_Name = {Text = "21 Grams"},
  Stage_80250_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A tiny butterfly drifts through dreams and into reality.
Perhaps it may be excessively naive, but the butterfly's choice is different from that of humans.]]
  },
  Stage_80250_Name = {
    Text = "Butterfly Flight"
  },
  Stage_80251_Desc = {
    Text = "Let me see—what components and structures constitute \"you\" and \"me.\""
  },
  Stage_80251_Name = {Text = "Eyes"},
  Stage_80252_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh, my friend, we all dream.
It's just that some people can turn their dreams into reality, while for others, their reality is just as absurd as a dream.]]
  },
  Stage_80252_Name = {
    Text = "Untamed Dreams"
  },
  Stage_80253_Desc = {
    Text = "I want to dance in the lost memories, forgetting those who love me and those I love; dancing eternally with myself, until the end of time."
  },
  Stage_80253_Name = {
    Text = "Lost Memory"
  },
  Stage_80254_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Run, run, little puppy, hurry and escape.
Entertain us with your panic and wretched despair.]]
  },
  Stage_80254_Name = {Text = "The Chase"},
  Stage_80255_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Watching you; I am watching you.
At every moment, at all times, just watching you.]]
  },
  Stage_80255_Name = {
    Text = "Gaze of the Other"
  },
  Stage_80256_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Memories are unreliable; for as I rummage through them, they begin to deteriorate and fade. What can be done to immortalize your presence? 
If memories are not solid, let them be etched in life's essence.]]
  },
  Stage_80256_Name = {
    Text = "Similar Silhouettes"
  },
  Stage_80257_Desc = {
    Text = "The first three shots were merely a prelude.\nWith the last two shots—one takes his life, one takes his soul."
  },
  Stage_80257_Name = {
    Text = "Five Gunshots"
  },
  Stage_80258_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Curiosity\" has thrown a question at you—even knowing the answer is fraught with thorns and will burn you to ashes, you cannot refuse.\nYou are, after all, the cat who cannot refuse \"Curiosity\"."
  },
  Stage_80258_Name = {
    Text = "Curiosity Kills the Cat"
  },
