  },
  Stage_8124_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Hand\" lifts the curtain of night, quietly arriving into this world."
  },
  Stage_8124_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive IV"
  },
  Stage_8125_Desc = {
    Text = "The disease ravaging here is no ordinary illness."
  },
  Stage_8125_Name = {Text = "Malady"},
  Stage_8126_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You and Ramona head to Lilian's Workhouse, located in the eastern district of
Londinium for your first investigation as a new Keeper.
Everything will go smoothly, right?]]
  },
  Stage_8126_Name = {
    Text = "Looks Deceive"
  },
  Stage_8127_Desc = {
    Text = "Ghosts lurk in the shadows—whether it be underground or within the human heart."
  },
  Stage_8127_Name = {
    Text = "Ghost Underground"
  },
  Stage_8128_Desc = {
    Text = "No oxygen to breathe, not even the faint light of a match; this is an absolutely pitch-black dream."
  },
  Stage_8128_Name = {
    Text = "Pitch-Black Dream"
  },
  Stage_8129_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"Each key has a unique number, corresponding only to a single investigator."
"Thus, the fall of each key signifies the death of a single investigator."
"How wonderful. Even their death is unique."]]
  },
  Stage_8129_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive VII"
  },
  Stage_8130_Desc = {
    Text = [[
