"How wonderful. Even their death is unique."]]
  },
  Stage_8135_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive I"
  },
  Stage_8137_Desc = {
    Text = "She is the boundary where dreams and reality intertwine—the reflection dwelling in the depths of every soul that gazes upon the night sky."
  },
  Stage_8137_Name = {
    Text = "Twisted Stars"
  },
  Stage_8138_Desc = {
    Text = "A crude, undigested mass. People call it excrement—or chaos.\nThe world was born from excrement."
  },
  Stage_8138_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Cluster II"
  },
  Stage_8139_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Wriggling, seeping... The protoplasmic mass slips through the fissures of its shackles.
This is the price she pays for "freedom."]]
  },
  Stage_8139_Name = {
    Text = "Chain of Darkness IV"
  },
  Stage_8140_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They twist and merge in the dark, then are carefully preserved within the idols.
This is a premeditated reunion.]]
  },
  Stage_8140_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Fissure V"
  },
  Stage_8141_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Here lie the ruins of an ancient city in slumber.
It sleeps as deeply as its master.]]
  },
  Stage_8141_Name = {
    Text = "Ruins of Pohnpei III"
  },
  Stage_8142_Desc = {
    Text = "What blinded her eyes?\nLove, pity, justice—or an excess of gratitude?"
  },
  Stage_8142_Name = {
    Text = "Transcendence"
  },
  Stage_8143_Desc = {
    Text = "Sharp spines pierced through the previously flawless arc—what emerged from the rift was something other than \"Cerberus\"."
  },
  Stage_8143_Name = {
    Text = "Cracked Carapace"
  },
  Stage_8144_Desc = {
    Text = "How can a sunset endure forever?"
  },
  Stage_8144_Name = {Text = "Sunset"},
  Stage_8145_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Hand\" lifts the curtain of night, quietly arriving into this world."
  },
  Stage_8145_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive I"
  },
  Stage_8146_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_8146_Name = {
    Text = "Aequor Legacy: Fissure II"
  },
  Stage_8147_Desc = {
    Text = "Crack—it splits.\nSnap—it breaks."
  },
  Stage_8147_Name = {Text = "Dollhouse"},
  Stage_8148_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The "Gate" has been opened. The illusion nears its end.
Hush... Do not look. Do not listen.]]
  },
  Stage_8148_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Rotation Gap IV"
  },
  Stage_8149_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The "Gate" has been opened. The illusion nears its end.
Hush... Do not look. Do not listen.]]
  },
  Stage_8149_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Rotation Gap IV"
  },
  Stage_8150_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The "Gate" has been opened. The illusion nears its end.
Hush... Do not look. Do not listen.]]
  },
  Stage_8150_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Rotation Gap IV"
  },
  Stage_8151_Desc = {
    Text = "Déjà vu and reality are tearing the Keeper in two—one half left in memory, the other half left in the present."
  },
  Stage_8151_Name = {Text = "Dagger"},
  Stage_8152_Desc = {
    Text = "The port at night, the simple residents, and their warm hospitality."
  },
  Stage_8152_Name = {Text = "The Ambush"},
  Stage_8153_Desc = {
    Text = "A cliché start: a lone amnesiac Keeper.\nThe difference is that this time, {Male=he,Female=she} awakens on the lonely sea."
  },
  Stage_8153_Name = {
    Text = "Eye of the Storm"
  },
  Stage_8154_Desc = {
    Text = "Apostle of the Seas."
  },
  Stage_8154_Name = {Text = "Apostle"},
  Stage_8155_Desc = {
    Text = "On a ship, who else is worthy of trust but the captain?"
  },
  Stage_8155_Name = {
    Text = "Crew Member"
  },
  Stage_8156_Desc = {
    Text = "When there's no way out, a well-trained partner is often the key to breaking through—Ramona has taught you this lesson once again."
  },
  Stage_8156_Name = {Text = "No Escape"},
  Stage_8157_Desc = {
    Text = "That which traverses the many seas includes not only enemies, but also, perhaps, a glimmer of hope."
  },
  Stage_8157_Name = {
    Text = "The Indulgent"
  },
  Stage_8158_Desc = {
    Text = "It was the colossal blade of one who intended to cleave the ocean; it was the ambition of one who intended to subjugate all seas."
  },
  Stage_8158_Name = {
    Text = "Madman's Cleaver"
  },
  Stage_8159_Desc = {
    Text = "A nightmare that never dissolved—a twisted reality that shadowed her all her life."
  },
  Stage_8159_Name = {
    Text = "Warped Reality"
  },
  Stage_8160_Desc = {
    Text = [[
They twist and merge in the dark, then are carefully preserved within the idols.
This is a premeditated reunion.]]
  },
  Stage_8160_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Fissure V"
  },
  Stage_8161_Desc = {
    Text = "Londinium is renowned for its resplendent industrial civilization and the leaden fog that shrouds the city.\nThe fog is omnipresent—to passersby, little more than an incidental, meaningless inconvenience."
  },
  Stage_8161_Name = {
    Text = "City of Big Smoke IV"
  },
  Stage_8162_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The curved horizon hidden in the depths of the cosmos.
It leads you from one darkness into another.]]
  },
  Stage_8162_Name = {
    Text = "Schwarzschild Throat IV"
  },
  Stage_8163_Desc = {
    Text = "The void is our origin. The void is our end."
  },
  Stage_8163_Name = {
    Text = "Whispers of the Immortal"
  },
  Stage_8164_Desc = {
    Text = "Under the desolate railway bridge, a massive, bloated monster emits strange growls. To reach the Rye Sanatorium, you must first cross here."
  },
  Stage_8164_Name = {
    Text = "The Current Will Guide You"
  },
  Stage_8165_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Elworth sits at the pole of Kadath, perpetually shrouded in ice and snow that never thaws.
Beneath the thick, unyielding shell of ice, the faint pulse of life lies concealed.]]
  },
  Stage_8165_Name = {
    Text = "Distorted Mountains I"
  },
  Stage_8166_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_8166_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Domain: Fissure Ⅷ"
  },
  Stage_8167_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"It is the One. It is the All. It is the hope which opens the gate of Truth."
Countless keys formed a circle. They fall from the heavens, bringing humanity a heavy hope.
And heavy graves.]]
  },
  Stage_8167_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive IV"
  },
  Stage_8168_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Gate\" is about to open, revealing a glimpse of the truth.\nIt's neither black nor white—truth is chromatic yet murky."
  },
  Stage_8168_Name = {
    Text = "Caro Marsh: Fissure III"
  },
  Stage_8169_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"It is the One. It is the All. It is the hope which opens the gate of Truth."
Countless keys formed a circle. They fall from the heavens, bringing humanity a heavy hope.
And heavy graves.]]
  },
  Stage_8169_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive VI"
  },
