And heavy graves.]]
  },
  Stage_8172_Name = {
    Text = "Phantasmal Dive II"
  },
  Stage_8173_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Idols of unknown origin wander and shudder in the darkness.
They move to ancient rhythms, drawn by the sound of a distant flute.]]
  },
  Stage_8173_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Journey: Fissure II"
  },
  Stage_8174_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He cannot be Him, and He can never be him.
Yes... Yes, only my God is the true Him.]]
  },
  Stage_8174_Name = {Text = "Lost Light"},
  Stage_81757_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The radiant the Divine Realm gradually appeared in your opened eyes.
There, you will receive the promise and have everything.]]
  },
  Stage_81757_Name = {
    Text = "Divine Whispers"
  },
  Stage_81758_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Through that ivory statuette, His gaze descends upon the mortal world.
From this moment, both you and I are submerged in His will.]]
  },
  Stage_81758_Name = {
    Text = "Celestial Witness"
  },
  Stage_81759_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The boundless cosmos converges within you, like stars rushing toward the moment of alignment.
Answer this summons from the void. His offspring. His puppet.]]
  },
  Stage_81759_Name = {
    Text = "The Void Beckons"
  },
  Stage_8175_Desc = {
    Text = "Reality sows the seeds of ruin, while destiny guides the encounter."
  },
  Stage_8175_Name = {
    Text = "Fate's Seed"
  },
  Stage_81760_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The gap between illusion and reality, the ritual has begun.
Rejoice, shout, your joy and pain will transcend dimensions, becoming the hymn of the Divine Realm's arrival.]]
  },
  Stage_81760_Name = {
    Text = "Ritual Echoes"
  },
  Stage_81761_Desc = {
    Text = [[
All the ecstasy has passed.
You drag your split body, extend your Tentacles, and let out a horrifying and desecrating screech as your first cry after awakening.

"His divine realm will finally arrive."]]
  },
  Stage_81761_Name = {
    Text = "Unjust Devotion"
  },
  Stage_81762_Desc = {
    Text = "Ah—listen to this voice of chaos, this endless phantasmagoria.\nThe god has issued His divine decree, and you, as His offspring and puppet, will carry it out with absolute fidelity."
  },
  Stage_81762_Name = {
    Text = "Sovereign's Decree"
  },
  Stage_81763_Desc = {
    Text = "The quickening heartbeat is merely a precursor to the stirring of flesh.\nDo not panic—it is only the sound of your blood awakening."
  },
  Stage_81763_Name = {
    Text = "Hollow Tremors"
  },
  Stage_8176_Desc = {
    Text = "A second heart beats within Murphy—we must prevent the imminent \"Birth Ritual\"."
  },
  Stage_8176_Name = {
    Text = "Another Miracle"
  },
  Stage_8177_Desc = {
    Text = "Breaking through is never simple. But this time, the Keeper has found the brightest star in the firmament."
  },
  Stage_8177_Name = {
    Text = "Pursuit of Stars"
  },
  Stage_81781_Desc = {
    Text = "That unseen disaster revives, swallowing the past and present of this material world into the depths of the abyss."
  },
  Stage_81781_Name = {
    Text = "D-Effect Zone: Wave 3: Madness"
  },
  Stage_81782_Desc = {
