    Text = "He was born simple and dull, constrained by a mundane life, blind and stubborn. But who says the simple-minded cannot forge a new path? Every prison is merely a storm waiting to hatch—even knowing nothing, he will still spread his wings and fly bravely toward the unknown sky."
  },
  Stage_88923_Name = {
    Text = "The Fool: Part III"
  },
  Stage_88924_Desc = {
    Text = "The desert is composed of scorching heat, aridity, wind and grit, endless dunes, agile reptiles, cacti—and a beauty with skin like honey."
  },
  Stage_88924_Name = {
    Text = "Sand and Honey"
  },
  Stage_88925_Desc = {
    Text = [[
I hold the fire you once ignited.
You once guided me, I will be your eyes, leading you to see the light again.
The path you walked, I will move forward for you, all the rusted fences will collapse before this fire.]]
  },
  Stage_88925_Name = {
    Text = "Candlebearer: Madness"
  },
  Stage_88926_Desc = {
    Text = [[
If born in a cage, can one be naturally bound?
If buried deep underground, one strives to break the soil and be reborn.]]
  },
  Stage_88926_Name = {
    Text = "Shattered Shackles: Part II"
  },
  Stage_88927_Desc = {
    Text = "The sand is like a sea—when the wind stills, its waves lie low; when the wind surges, all life is extinguished.\nHe soars through the endless sea of sand, unyielding as a storm petrel."
  },
  Stage_88927_Name = {
    Text = "Endless Sand: Part III"
  },
  Stage_88928_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Since the day he opened his eyes, they have never been able to close again.
Since the day he glimpsed the sky, it has never left his heart.
If freedom must be purchased with death, he will offer his life without a moment's hesitation.]]
  },
  Stage_88928_Name = {
    Text = "Freedom and Death: Part VI"
  },
  Stage_88929_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Since the day he opened his eyes, they have never been able to close again.
Since the day he glimpsed the sky, it has never left his heart.
If freedom must be purchased with death, he will offer his life without a moment's hesitation.]]
  },
  Stage_88929_Name = {
    Text = "Freedom and Death: Part II"
  },
  Stage_88930_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He has always had two shadows. Now one of them is lost.
He walks alone beneath the silent night sky, singing the rhyme they composed together in childhood.
Birds, birds, where are you...
Shadow, shadow, come back home...]]
  },
  Stage_88930_Name = {
    Text = "Solitude Journey: Part I"
  },
  Stage_88931_Desc = {
    Text = [[
I hold the fire you once ignited.
You once guided me, I will be your eyes, leading you to see the light again.
The path you walked, I will move forward for you, all the rusted fences will collapse before this fire.]]
  },
  Stage_88931_Name = {
    Text = "Candlebearer: Part I"
  },
  Stage_88932_Desc = {
    Text = "He was born simple and dull, constrained by a mundane life, blind and stubborn. But who says the simple-minded cannot forge a new path? Every prison is merely a storm waiting to hatch—even knowing nothing, he will still spread his wings and fly bravely toward the unknown sky."
  },
  Stage_88932_Name = {
    Text = "The Fool: Part V"
  },
  Stage_89731_Desc = {
    Text = "That single tear, slowly falling, crystalline like pure ice flowers."
  },
  Stage_89731_Name = {
    Text = "A Drop of Tear"
  },
  Stage_89732_Desc = {
    Text = "Run, Hide, Track, Tug—the Hunter has raised the dark barrel of the gun."
  },
  Stage_89732_Name = {Text = "The Hunt"},
  Stage_90490_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Awakeners born from Chaos stand by your side, and your Silver Key trembles with excitement.
Fight alongside them and learn how to unleash the hidden potential of the Silver Key.]]
  },
  Stage_90490_Name = {
    Text = "Chaos Epiphany"
  },
  Stage_90662_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When the bells of the cemetery chime, the spreading black mist will dissipate in the dream.
Push open the heavy coffin; the magnificent royal city has descended before you.]]
  },
  Stage_90662_Name = {
    Text = "Beneath Dream's Veil"
  },
  Stage_90663_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Listen, to the weeping of the ocean.
The followers earnestly plead. They plead with the Lord to respond to their prayers; plead for the Lord to bless their blood.]]
  },
  Stage_90663_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Sacrifice"
  },
  Stage_90664_Desc = {
    Text = "\"O bones slumbering in this land, spirits wandering the night sky—\nBy the name of the King of the Ghouls, the Lord of Necrovia, I summon you to return once more to the land you cherish.\nI invite you to join me in savoring the enemy's offering at the Ossuary Gala!\""
  },
  Stage_90664_Name = {
    Text = "Dance of the Myriad Souls"
  },
  Stage_90665_Desc = {
    Text = "The oath of eternal companionship was made long before the pledge of utmost loyalty."
  },
  Stage_90665_Name = {Text = "Oath"},
  Stage_90666_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sin? Conspiracy? Death?
The painter had no time to care about these. In his eyes, there was only the grand spectacle formed by the bodies.]]
  },
  Stage_90666_Name = {Text = "Painter"},
  Stage_90667_Desc = {
    Text = "The oath of eternal companionship was made long before the pledge of utmost loyalty."
  },
  Stage_90667_Name = {Text = "Oath"},
  Stage_90670_Desc = {
    Text = "Among all the qualities of Necrovia's ruler, his taste for gourmet cuisine is of utmost importance."
  },
  Stage_90670_Name = {
    Text = "Culinary Art of Corpses"
  },
  Stage_90671_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A memory of blood-related kin: the story of a city-state's royal family, a heavy and magnificent history.
A memory of a commoner: the story of an ordinary family, a negligible footnote.
To the King of Necrovia, they should not, and will not, be any different.]]
  },
  Stage_90671_Name = {
    Text = "Inconsequential Footnote"
  },
  Stage_90672_Desc = {
    Text = [[
"The strings have risen to the heavens, all the formalities have vanished with the mist.
My dear subjects, rejoice. Tear away the shroud of hypocrisy and reveal the primal hunger beneath.
Tonight, the poet's throat will sing for us.
Tonight, the Mother's arms will embrace us."]]
  },
  Stage_90672_Name = {
    Text = "Moonlit Skeleton Dance"
  },
  Stage_90674_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He is the Monarch of Necrovia. He is the host of this banquet.
He opens his arms to all guests, inviting them to leave the dance floor.
Upon the corpses scattered across the cemetery, he dances with the Abyss.]]
  },
  Stage_90674_Name = {
    Text = "Lord of Necrovia"
  },
  Stage_90676_Desc = {
    Text = [[
When the bells of the cemetery chime, the spreading black mist will dissipate in the dream.
Push open the heavy coffin; the magnificent royal city has descended before you.]]
  },
  Stage_90676_Name = {
    Text = "Beneath Dream's Veil"
  },
  Stage_90679_Desc = {
    Text = "Among all the qualities of Necrovia's ruler, his taste for gourmet cuisine is of utmost importance."
  },
  Stage_90679_Name = {
    Text = "Culinary Art of Corpses"
  },
  Stage_90680_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Voices in dreams, forgotten civilizations, traces of old friends...
Everything you want to know is waiting for you over the distant sea.]]
  },
  Stage_90680_Name = {
    Text = "Beyond the Tides"
  },
  Stage_90681_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Listen, to the weeping of the ocean.
The followers earnestly plead. They plead with the Lord to respond to their prayers; plead for the Lord to bless their blood.]]
  },
  Stage_90681_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Sacrifice"
  },
  Stage_90684_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Who is this elderly ghoul before her? Why are his clothes in tatters? Why are his eyes flooded with tears?
Why does he weep, calling out the name Elena, in a voice most tender yet hoarse?
She cannot remember anything.
Moonlight falls upon her corpse, as beautiful as she was on her wedding day, her veil billowing in the wind.]]
  },
  Stage_90684_Name = {
    Text = "Funeral & Wedding Gown"
  },
  Stage_90685_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Who is this elderly ghoul before her? Why are his clothes in tatters? Why are his eyes flooded with tears?
Why does he weep, calling out the name Elena, in a voice most tender yet hoarse?
