  },
  Stage_91088_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Master and servant, murderer and slain: They are two relics of a fallen age.
Bound by blood's hunger, they meet as fate decrees at the selfsame gate.]]
  },
  Stage_91088_Name = {
    Text = "Slave and Master"
  },
  Stage_91091_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Who dares claim the past is dead?
Behold, wretched spawn of modern artifice! Rome's iron tread shall grind you to dust!]]
  },
  Stage_91091_Name = {
    Text = "Might of the Romans"
  },
  Stage_94464_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Awakeners from the Aequor bring the mighty power hidden beneath the ocean depths before you.
Fight alongside them and learn how to wield the power of Tentacles.]]
  },
  Stage_94464_Name = {
    Text = "Aequor Tendrils"
  },
  Stage_94465_Desc = {
    Text = "Caro is the origin of life, and also the end of life. Death begets life—the Awakeners forged from pure Caro understand this best.\nFight alongside them and learn how to harness the power of Caro."
  },
  Stage_94465_Name = {
    Text = "Caro Propagation"
  },
  Stage_94466_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Awakeners who traverse the Ultra have yet to fathom its secrets. On the day you unravel them, you will glimpse a power that will astound you.
Fight alongside them and learn how to utilize Ultra Space in combat.]]
  },
  Stage_94466_Name = {
    Text = "Ultra Dominion"
  },
  Stage_94806_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A wonderful holiday shouldn't be ruined by rudeness and violence.
f you want to fight, let's settle it on the volleyball court!]]
  },
  Stage_94806_Name = {Text = "Beach Duel"},
  Stage_94808_Desc = {
    Text = "The champion deserves a few small privileges."
  },
  Stage_94808_Name = {
    Text = "Champion & Chaos"
  },
  Stage_94811_Desc = {
    Text = "One who strives for first place would never fall in the same spot twice!"
  },
  Stage_94811_Name = {
    Text = "Match Point"
  },
  Stage_94817_Desc = {
    Text = "People use rules to manage entropy's inevitable rise.\nIn reality, everyone has their own principles; when dozens collide, the only rule here is—there are none!"
  },
  Stage_94817_Name = {
    Text = "Pairing Rules"
  },
  Stage_94824_Desc = {
    Text = "A tranquil night, a gentle sea breeze, under the stars' tender gaze—\nAlways the perfect time to share a secret."
  },
  Stage_94824_Name = {
    Text = "Secrets in the Breeze"
  },
  Stage_94832_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She knows: reckless bravery alone cannot secure an unrivaled victory.
It was true then, and it is true now.]]
  },
  Stage_94832_Name = {
    Text = "Narrow Victory"
  },
  Stage_94837_Desc = {
    Text = "If I could freeze this joy, I would make that memory last forever."
  },
  Stage_94837_Name = {Text = "One Photo"},
  Stage_94841_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Seaside. The go-to place for vacations!
Under the scorching sun, who could resist wading into the cool waves or taking refuge from the blaze beneath a parasol?
Wait... why is the sun falling?!]]
  },
  Stage_94841_Name = {
    Text = "Heatwave Alert"
  },
  Stage_94843_Desc = {
    Text = [[
On the intense battlefield, each contestant displays a unique flair...
Director, cut all the unairable flairs.]]
  },
  Stage_94843_Name = {
    Text = "Game On! Semifinals!"
  },
  Stage_95332_Desc = {
    Text = "To take their hand is to sign a contract with Death. The time of payment is always unknown."
  },
  Stage_95332_Name = {
    Text = "Bargain's Core: VI"
  },
  Stage_95333_Desc = {
    Text = "To take their hand is to sign a contract with Death. The time of payment is always unknown."
  },
  Stage_95333_Name = {
    Text = "Bargain's Core: V"
  },
  Stage_95334_Desc = {
    Text = "To take their hand is to sign a contract with Death. The time of payment is always unknown."
  },
  Stage_95334_Name = {
    Text = "Bargain's Core: Madness"
  },
  Stage_95335_Desc = {
    Text = "Every cell in your body repeats, can only repeat one phrase: The Light is here."
  },
  Stage_95335_Name = {
    Text = "All-Consuming Pyre: III"
  },
  Stage_95336_Desc = {
    Text = "The sun descends upon the earth, a horrifying ascent from the abyss. All things melt into tribute for its greatness."
  },
  Stage_95336_Name = {
    Text = "False Sun on Earth: III"
  },
  Stage_95337_Desc = {
    Text = "When the sun returns to the abyss, the world will fall silent. For nothing but ash remains."
  },
  Stage_95337_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Ruins: I"
  },
  Stage_95338_Desc = {
    Text = "When the sun returns to the abyss, the world will fall silent. For nothing but ash remains."
  },
  Stage_95338_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Ruins: III"
  },
  Stage_95339_Desc = {
    Text = "When the sun returns to the abyss, the world will fall silent. For nothing but ash remains."
  },
  Stage_95339_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Ruins: Madness"
  },
  Stage_95340_Desc = {
    Text = [[
She does not take the sound; she wishes to hear the wails of the guilty.
Billions of lights dance in the midnight sun, their song intertwining with the screams in perfect harmony.]]
  },
  Stage_95340_Name = {
    Text = "Hymn of Cinders: I"
  },
  Stage_95341_Desc = {
    Text = "When the sun returns to the abyss, the world will fall silent. For nothing but ash remains."
  },
  Stage_95341_Name = {
    Text = "Silent Ruins: IV"
  },
  Stage_95342_Desc = {
    Text = "She arrives with fervent flames, pronouncing your sins. Your final atonement is to resist, to entertain Her as long as you can."
  },
  Stage_95342_Name = {
    Text = "Scorching Doom: I"
  },
  Stage_95343_Desc = {
    Text = "To take their hand is to sign a contract with Death. The time of payment is always unknown."
  },
  Stage_95343_Name = {
    Text = "Bargain's Core: III"
