  Stage_95706_Desc = {
    Text = "Those sorrowful, beautiful souls, burdened with countless memories, are precisely what make each ingredient unique.\nLet every layer battle and clash upon your tongue, until finally you merge into one.\n—The moment every deceased has long awaited their entire life... is the instant of being devoured."
  },
  Stage_95706_Name = {
    Text = "Reliquary Feast: VI"
  },
  Stage_95707_Desc = {
    Text = [[
0.5 inches deep, perpendicular to the direction of the meridians.
Along the spine and shoulder blade, separate the bone from the meat.
The body is the chef's chessboard.]]
  },
  Stage_95707_Name = {
    Text = "Marrow Severance: VI"
  },
  Stage_95708_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Can you smell it? The fresh scent of oak, cedar, and vetiver.
Its owner has been lying in this beautiful coffin for three hundred years.
Because of that, it has earned the honor of being the main course of this banquet.]]
  },
  Stage_95708_Name = {
    Text = "Sunken Coffin Rites: VI"
  },
  Stage_95709_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Can you smell it? The fresh scent of oak, cedar, and vetiver.
Its owner has been lying in this beautiful coffin for three hundred years.
Because of that, it has earned the honor of being the main course of this banquet.]]
  },
  Stage_95709_Name = {
    Text = "Sunken Coffin Rites: II"
  },
  Stage_95710_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Salt. Parsley. Lemongrass. Olive. Rosemary.
A piece of advice: no matter how good the ingredients are, never underestimate the power of spices.
On this chessboard, spices are the pieces of the cook.]]
  },
  Stage_95710_Name = {
    Text = "Humus Perfumery: III"
  },
  Stage_95711_Desc = {
    Text = [[
We praise taste and eternity, yet fire is their antonym.
But the most enduring and exquisite flavors in the world come from fire itself.
Isn't that a perfect irony?]]
  },
  Stage_95711_Name = {
    Text = "Ghostfire Torment: I"
