  Stage_95742_Name = {
    Text = "Humus Perfumery: IV"
  },
  Stage_97057_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The frenzied dancers spin around the illusory idol, with no one caring for the remnants of faith, only the vortex of Joy tightening uncontrollably.
In this moment, all shame and hesitation dissolve into nothingness in the fervent whirl, as all beings dance wildly for the phantasm.
Pickman laughs heartily, inviting you to join this ecstatic dance.]]
  },
  Stage_97057_Name = {
    Text = "Taurus Mad Dance: IV"
  },
  Stage_97058_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Inspiration is the forbidden fruit for those content with mediocrity.
Yet, upon this canvas, the exaggerated composition reveals the essence of art.
Inspiration arrives like a sudden storm, bursting into the heart without invitation.
In that moment, the hidden unease and desire awaken, like a flame piercing through the night, illuminating the heart with clarity and intensity.]]
  },
  Stage_97058_Name = {
    Text = "Inspiration Invasion: III"
  },
  Stage_97059_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Has anyone ever seen such mad lines?
Each trail has broken free from the chains of perspective, running wildly across the paper like rioting prisoners.
They intertwine, clash, and devour each other, drawing the hidden truth in Pickman's eyes with a distorted dance.]]
  },
  Stage_97059_Name = {
    Text = "Wraith of the Line: III"
  },
  Stage_97060_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Has anyone ever seen such mad lines?
Each trail has broken free from the chains of perspective, running wildly across the paper like rioting prisoners.
They intertwine, clash, and devour each other, drawing the hidden truth in Pickman's eyes with a distorted dance.]]
  },
  Stage_97060_Name = {
    Text = "Wraith of the Line: V"
  },
  Stage_97061_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An ordinary painter? No, no.
Vivid red strokes surge forth, the eerie whirlpools quickly drowning the pale and clear.
The bright and gloomy crimson spreads, infusing the entire piece with a breath of restlessness and life.
Only this blood-like color is the most vivid and real existence in the world!]]
  },
  Stage_97061_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Spread: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97062_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An ordinary painter? No, no.
Vivid red strokes surge forth, the eerie whirlpools quickly drowning the pale and clear.
The bright and gloomy crimson spreads, infusing the entire piece with a breath of restlessness and life.
Only this blood-like color is the most vivid and real existence in the world!]]
  },
  Stage_97062_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Spread: II"
  },
  Stage_97063_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The frenzied dancers spin around the illusory idol, with no one caring for the remnants of faith, only the vortex of Joy tightening uncontrollably.
In this moment, all shame and hesitation dissolve into nothingness in the fervent whirl, as all beings dance wildly for the phantasm.
Pickman laughs heartily, inviting you to join this ecstatic dance.]]
  },
  Stage_97063_Name = {
    Text = "Taurus Mad Dance: V"
  },
  Stage_97064_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Inspiration is the forbidden fruit for those content with mediocrity.
Yet, upon this canvas, the exaggerated composition reveals the essence of art.
Inspiration arrives like a sudden storm, bursting into the heart without invitation.
In that moment, the hidden unease and desire awaken, like a flame piercing through the night, illuminating the heart with clarity and intensity.]]
  },
  Stage_97064_Name = {
    Text = "Inspiration Invasion: IV"
  },
  Stage_97065_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The unknown suffering roars in the depths of color. Horrific scenes emerge, the flames of the other shore and twisted shadows crowding and entwining with each other.
At this moment, the canvas becomes a prison of sin and punishment, each inch flickering with intense punishment and pain.
The world has turned upside down, all goodness submerged, revealing the truth of the soul in the hell of burning and suffering.
Do you see it? This is the beauty of art.]]
  },
  Stage_97065_Name = {
    Text = "Revolution in Hell: V"
  },
  Stage_97066_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The soul burns fiercely on the canvas, transparent oil slowly flows, the blood color freezes into an eternal world, madness is the true brew of reality.
Only by abandoning worldly clarity and plunging into the chaotic ecstasy can one finally touch the essence of art.
Ah, I wish to eternally sink into this ultimate ecstasy and despair!
Come, after this mad banquet, welcome the beautiful new world.]]
  },
  Stage_97066_Name = {
    Text = "Carnival Freeze: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97067_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An ordinary painter? No, no.
Vivid red strokes surge forth, the eerie whirlpools quickly drowning the pale and clear.
The bright and gloomy crimson spreads, infusing the entire piece with a breath of restlessness and life.
Only this blood-like color is the most vivid and real existence in the world!]]
  },
  Stage_97067_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Spread: III"
  },
  Stage_97068_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Pickman's frenzied strokes churn the oils, the brush soaked with the bitterness of flesh and soul.
Chaotic trails meander across the canvas, nightmares and illusions quietly emerging from the abyss of color.
The world within the painting gradually distorts and sinks in this uncontrolled haze...]]
  },
  Stage_97068_Name = {
    Text = "Nightmare Pile: IV"
  },
  Stage_97069_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The soul burns fiercely on the canvas, transparent oil slowly flows, the blood color freezes into an eternal world, madness is the true brew of reality.
Only by abandoning worldly clarity and plunging into the chaotic ecstasy can one finally touch the essence of art.
Ah, I wish to eternally sink into this ultimate ecstasy and despair!
Come, after this mad banquet, welcome the beautiful new world.]]
  },
  Stage_97069_Name = {
    Text = "Carnival Freeze: VI"
  },
  Stage_97070_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Has anyone ever seen such mad lines?
Each trail has broken free from the chains of perspective, running wildly across the paper like rioting prisoners.
They intertwine, clash, and devour each other, drawing the hidden truth in Pickman's eyes with a distorted dance.]]
  },
  Stage_97070_Name = {
    Text = "Wraith of the Line: I"
  },
  Stage_97071_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The unknown suffering roars in the depths of color. Horrific scenes emerge, the flames of the other shore and twisted shadows crowding and entwining with each other.
At this moment, the canvas becomes a prison of sin and punishment, each inch flickering with intense punishment and pain.
The world has turned upside down, all goodness submerged, revealing the truth of the soul in the hell of burning and suffering.
Do you see it? This is the beauty of art.]]
  },
  Stage_97071_Name = {
    Text = "Revolution in Hell: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97072_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Inspiration is the forbidden fruit for those content with mediocrity.
Yet, upon this canvas, the exaggerated composition reveals the essence of art.
Inspiration arrives like a sudden storm, bursting into the heart without invitation.
In that moment, the hidden unease and desire awaken, like a flame piercing through the night, illuminating the heart with clarity and intensity.]]
  },
  Stage_97072_Name = {
    Text = "Inspiration Invasion: V"
  },
  Stage_97073_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Pickman's frenzied strokes churn the oils, the brush soaked with the bitterness of flesh and soul.
Chaotic trails meander across the canvas, nightmares and illusions quietly emerging from the abyss of color.
The world within the painting gradually distorts and sinks in this uncontrolled haze...]]
  },
  Stage_97073_Name = {
    Text = "Nightmare Pile: I"
  },
  Stage_97074_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An ordinary painter? No, no.
Vivid red strokes surge forth, the eerie whirlpools quickly drowning the pale and clear.
The bright and gloomy crimson spreads, infusing the entire piece with a breath of restlessness and life.
Only this blood-like color is the most vivid and real existence in the world!]]
  },
  Stage_97074_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Spread: VI"
