  },
  Stage_97105_Name = {
    Text = "Revolution in Hell: IV"
  },
  Stage_97227_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The feast is ready. The Sacrifice has arrived.
O Ever-Burning Master, seated in the fire-worlds, claim Your faithful from the ashes.]]
  },
  Stage_97227_Name = {
    Text = "Blood Sacrifice"
  },
  Stage_97228_Desc = {
    Text = "The Black Sun has descended. The sky is made of ash."
  },
  Stage_97228_Name = {
    Text = "The Black Sun"
  },
  Stage_97229_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Their excuses vary: "tempted," "no choice," "for survival." So many elegant lies.
Pity they chose to betray the one person in this universe they never should have.]]
  },
  Stage_97229_Name = {
    Text = "Sound of Betrayal"
  },
  Stage_97230_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The mystery is revealed.
Did you guess the turn of the knife? I find it amusing. Your interest, or lack thereof, is quite irrelevant.]]
  },
  Stage_97230_Name = {
    Text = "The Mastermind"
  },
  Stage_97231_Desc = {
    Text = [[
In this cruel world, memory is our only luxury.
We keep a ledger of every favor, and never forget a single grudge.]]
  },
  Stage_97231_Name = {
    Text = "Never Forget"
  },
  Stage_97232_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Lift your hungover head and raise your grimy glass. Forget everything from last night; a new party is about to begin.
Welcome to expressionist paradise, my friend.]]
  },
  Stage_97232_Name = {
    Text = "Fauvist Pub"
  },
  Stage_97233_Desc = {
    Text = "The final drop fell from the cup, and the gunshot that buried everything rang out on time."
  },
  Stage_97233_Name = {
    Text = "Last Drop of Liquor"
  },
  Stage_97288_Desc = {
    Text = "Simulated Combat"
  },
  Stage_97288_Name = {
    Text = "Simulation Battle 3"
  },
  Stage_97615_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God called upon all things and matters to follow their own paths.
Roots dug deep into rotten soil, and claws, teeth, and feathers bit and crawled.
Blossoms grew upon withered bones, and the weak were swallowed by the mighty.
He granted all beings the right to intertwine and fight.]]
  },
  Stage_97615_Name = {
    Text = "The Fifth Day: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97616_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God has aligned the stars, making the sun and moon each perform their duties.
The remains of light and dark wander in a mad trail, guiding the lost souls that have been confused for thousands of years back home.
He granted the faithful the right to regain.]]
  },
  Stage_97616_Name = {
    Text = "The Third Day: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97617_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God caused the formless embryos to grow in the world.
Those with fins could swim in the sea, and those with wings could soar in the sky.
He granted whispered murmurs to help them breathe in the deep sea, and mad raving to accompany them through the clouds.]]
  },
  Stage_97617_Name = {
    Text = "The Fourth Day: Part IV"
  },
  Stage_97618_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God caused the formless embryos to grow in the world.
Those with fins could swim in the sea, and those with wings could soar in the sky.
He granted whispered murmurs to help them breathe in the deep sea, and mad raving to accompany them through the clouds.]]
  },
  Stage_97618_Name = {
    Text = "The Fourth Day: Part III"
  },
  Stage_97619_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The God separated heaven from earth, and earth from sea.
A sticky and pulsating curtain hung from the lofty sky, and the scent of sulfur and sea salt rose in the Abyss.
He bestowed upon the sea's children the right to walk all over.]]
  },
  Stage_97619_Name = {
    Text = "The Second Day: Part III"
  },
  Stage_97620_Desc = {
    Text = [[
