  },
  Stage_97622_Name = {
    Text = "The Second Day: Part IV"
  },
  Stage_97623_Desc = {
    Text = "Why does the God rot, why does the God bleed pus?\nGod, please guide me, please wake up, help me!—anything will do!\nOh, God, God...\nThere is nothing but absurd mistakes and false lies."
  },
  Stage_97623_Name = {
    Text = "The Seventh Day: VI"
  },
  Stage_97624_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God caused the formless embryos to grow in the world.
Those with fins could swim in the sea, and those with wings could soar in the sky.
He granted whispered murmurs to help them breathe in the deep sea, and mad raving to accompany them through the clouds.]]
  },
  Stage_97624_Name = {
    Text = "The Fourth Day: Part VI"
  },
  Stage_97625_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God molded an unintelligent and ignorant false form.
The sacrifices dragged down together cannot escape fate, God did not grant revelations, God did not respond; the sightless and voiceless infants bring false doctrines.
He granted the awakened the right to be intoxicated.]]
  },
