Those with fins could swim in the sea, and those with wings could soar in the sky.
He granted whispered murmurs to help them breathe in the deep sea, and mad raving to accompany them through the clouds.]]
  },
  Stage_97639_Name = {
    Text = "The Fourth Day: Madness"
  },
  Stage_97640_Desc = {
    Text = [[
God separated day from night with light in the chaos.
The writhing light spots tear through the eternal darkness, and His people no longer need to worry about the threat of darkness.
He granted everyone the right to sleep peacefully at night.]]
  },
  Stage_97640_Name = {
    Text = "The First Day: Part VI"
  },
  Stage_97641_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The God separated heaven from earth, and earth from sea.
A sticky and pulsating curtain hung from the lofty sky, and the scent of sulfur and sea salt rose in the Abyss.
He bestowed upon the sea's children the right to walk all over.]]
  },
  Stage_97641_Name = {
